<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Birifor Bible</book>
  <para style="rem">Typesetting of Birifor Joshua on 6-7th Oct 2025</para>
  <para style="h">Josʋwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">A Josʋwa Gan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Josʋwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos</para>
  <para style="mt1">Josʋwa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">A Nãaŋmɩn Na Kpãkpãan Josʋwa Ɩka Wʋ Tɩ Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ A Keena Nɩbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />A Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ kũu puor, Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba na ɩ a Mosesɩ sʋ̃sʋ̃nɔ ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />&lt;&lt;A n tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ kpi naa. A lɛ jũu, fʋ̃ʋ nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ banyãna ba jaa yɩ chɔɔr na yɩ gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan Man chen a wɛr 'lɔ N na kʋrɔ yɩ pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />&lt;N na kʋ yɩ naa jie jaa a yɩ gbɛr na wa nɛb nɩtãa a lɛ N na pol kʋ a Mosesɩ. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />A yɩ tɔraa na yin a dãlpʋɔ pɔ tɩ ta be a Lɛbanↄn, nɩ an yi a man kpɛ̃ɛ na ɩ a Yufɩratɩ nɩ a Heeti nɩbɛ paal wʋ jaa tɩ tan a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pɔ, a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie.&gt; <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Josʋwa, nɩrɛ jaa kʋ tʋ̃ɔ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ fʋ a fʋ nyɛvʋr pɔ ɛ. N na be naa a fʋ sɛ̃ nɩtãa a lɛ N na dɔ̃ɔ be a Mosesɩ sɛ̃. N na ma be naa a fʋ sɛ̃ sɔ̃ɔ jaa, N kʋ̃ barfʋ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />&lt;&lt;Ara kpɛ̃ɔ na fʋ nyɔɔ nyãa, bojũu fʋ̃ʋ lɛ na de a nɩbɛ banyãna nie ka yɩ tɩ de a wɛr N na dɔ̃ɔ pol kʋ a ba sãakpãmine. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Ara kpɛ̃ɔ na fʋ nyɔɔ nyãa, na fʋ sɔɔ tu a yelbinsɩ ala a jaa a N tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na kʋ fʋ. Taa wa bara a yelbinsɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ɛ, a lɛ na vɛ̃ naa ka fʋ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Ma kara a yelbinaa gan sɔ̃ɔ jaa, na fʋ ma tɩɛrɛ yaa mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ nɩ tɩ̃sɔɔ, na fʋ ma mɔ̃ ɩka fʋ tu a ala jaa ban sɛb a wʋ pɔ. A lɛ na vɛ̃ naa ka fʋ nyɛ̃ bɩɛlfʋ na fʋ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ bon jaa fʋn maala pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Tɩɛr a lɛ N na 'yɛr kʋ fʋ ɩka fʋ ara kpɛ̃ɔ, na fʋ nyɔɔ nyãa, na fʋ ta joro dãbɩ̃ɛ bɩɩ ka a fʋ ɩ̃gan chʋɔr ɛ, bojũu a maa na ɩ a fʋ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn ben a fʋ sɛ̃ jie jaa fʋn na wa chen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a wʋ nidierbe, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />ka ba chen a ba jaa-jie tɩ 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ chɔɔr bʋ̃diir bin, bojũu a ber ata daar, yɩ chiini naa na tɩ gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan man tɩ kpɩɛrɛ a jie 'lɔ a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn na kʋrɔ yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Be lɛ ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ bamine ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />&lt;&lt;Yɩ tɩɛr a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na 'yɛr kʋ yɩ, &lt;A yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn na kʋ yɩ naa a wɛr 'lɔ na be Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, be lɛ na ɩ a yɩ jaa-jie.&gt; <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />A yɩ pɔbɔ nɩ a yɩ bibiir nɩ a yɩ dʋn na be naa a jie nyãna tɩchɛ ka a yɩ jɛjɛɛrbɛ na tara a ba tã-jɛb bonsɩ chen a ba taaba Isɩral nɩbɛ sɛ̃ na ba tɩ sʋ̃ʋ ba <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />tɩ tan ban wa jɩnɛ a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, a wɛr 'lɔ a Nãaŋmɩn na de kʋ ba. Yɩ mɩ sʋ̃ʋ ba tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ yɩn wa jɛb a nɩbɛ bala na be a wɛr 'lɔ pɔ a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn na de kʋ yɩ. A lɛ puor, a yɩ nɩbɛ na tʋ̃ɔn lɩɛb chen tɩ jɩnɛ a yɩ mɩ̃ɛ wɛr pɔ, a 'lɔ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na kʋ yɩ a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ka ba 'yɛr sɔɔ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩn ɩ naa bon jaa fʋn 'yɛr kʋ sɩ, lɛ mɩ lɛ sɩn chen jie 'lɔ jaa fʋn na tʋ̃ sɩ. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Sɩn tu naa a fʋ nɛɛ nɩtãa a lɛ sɩn dɔ̃ɔ turo a Mosesɩ nɛɛ, a fʋ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn wʋ be a fʋ sɛ̃ nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ be a Mosesɩ sɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Nɩrɛ 'lɔ jaa na wa chɩɩr tɔr a fʋ nɛɛ sɛɛn kũu. Ara kpɛ̃ɔ na fʋ nyɔɔ nyãa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Josʋwa Na Tʋ̃ Nɩjʋʋrbɔ Be A Jɛrɩko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Josʋwa pãa tʋ̃n nɩjʋʋrbɔ ayi yin a ba jaa-jie a be a Sitim na wʋ 'yɛr ɩka ba tɩ jʋʋr a Keena wɛr, wa gar a jaa, a Jɛrɩko tẽe. Ban wa kpɛ a tẽe pɔ, ba chen tɩ gã pɔɔ sɛ̃sɛ̃nɛ kɔ̃ɔ ban bʋɔlɔ Wʋrahab yir.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Ka a Jɛrɩko nãa wa wõ ɩka, &lt;&lt;A Isɩral nɩbɛ bamine wan a tɩ̃sɔɔ nyãna ɩka ba wa jʋʋr a wɛr kaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Ka a nãa pãa tʋ̃ 'yɛr a Wʋrahab ɩka, &lt;&lt;A dɔɔr bala na wa a fʋ yir wan ɩka ba wa jʋʋr a wɛr wʋ jaa kaa, 'yir ba waan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4-6" />Ka a Wʋrahab 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Dɔɔr bamine wan a n yir, tɩchɛ n ba bɔ̃ɔ a jie ban yi ɛ, ba yi naa a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ na wa mʋrɔ sɛrɛ ka ba wa pɔɔ a tẽe dɔ̃dɔr kpɛ̃ɛ. N ba bɔ̃ɔ a jie ban chiini ɛ, tɩchɛ yɩn pɔɔ yi tu ba, yɩn tɩ pɔɔ ba naa.&gt;&gt; A Wʋrahab pãa den a nɩjʋʋrbɔ ayi banyãna sɔɔl bar be a gar ju bɩɩr-daar pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 2:4-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Be lɛ a nãa nɩbɛ yi na ba bɩɛrɛ a nɩjʋʋrbɔ, ba tun a sɔr 'lɔ na ɩ a Jɔɔdan gɔ̃ɔfʋ jie. Ban wa yi baar, ba pɔɔn a tẽe dɔ̃dɔr kpɛ̃ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Sɛrɛ tɩchɛ ka a nɩjʋʋrbɔ na gã a tɩ̃sɔɔ 'lɔnɔ, Wʋrahab don be a gar ju na wʋ <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />tɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;N bɔ̃ɔn na ɩka Nãaŋmɩn den a paal nyã kʋ yɩ, nɩrɛ jaa a paal pɔ pɩla ɔɔrɔ na a yɩ jũu. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Sɩ jaa wõn a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na vɛ̃ ka a man jɩɛ 'lɔ ko a yɩ niem a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ yɩn yi a Ijipitɩ paal pɔ. Na sɩ lɛ wõ a lɛ yɩn kʋ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine ayi na ɩ a Sihɔn nɩ a Ɔgi be a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ sɩ naa a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ sɩn wa wõ a lɛ, ka a lɛ vɛ̃ ka a sɩ ɩ̃gan sal a yɩ jũu. A yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ Nãaŋmɩn be naa a saaju nɩ a tẽe. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />A lɛ jũu, yɩ pɔn a yɩ Nãaŋmɩn ɩka yɩn maal a n yir deme vɩla nɩtãa a lɛ n na maal yɩ a vɩla, yɩ wiil ma jɩ̃nɛ 'lɔ n na de sɔ̃ɔn a lɛ yɩn 'yɛrɛ. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Yɩ pol kʋ ma ɩka yɩn faan a n sãa nɩ a n mã, a n yɛdɔɔr nɩ a n yɛɛr nɩ a ba yir deme ba jaa. Yɩ ta vɛ̃ ka ba kʋ sɩ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Ka a dɔɔr 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;A Ŋmɩn wʋ kʋ sɩ, sɩn ba wa tu a lɛ sɩn 'yɛr ɛ. Ala ɩ faa wa 'yɛr kʋ nɩrɛ jaa a lɛ sɩn waara ɩka sɩ wa tʋ̃ ɛ, sɩ pol kʋ fʋ ɩka, a Nãaŋmɩn wa de a paal nyã kʋ sɩ, sɩn maal yɩn vɩla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Wʋrahab kpɩɛrɛ na a yir 'lɔ ban mɛ mar a tẽe dachin. Wʋ den miir 'yɔ̃ɔ a die tokoro pɔ ka ba tu a be suu chen. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Tɩ pãa 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ chen a tẽn ala a tɔ̃ɔ ju, lɛ ba lɛ ɛ a nãa nɩbɛ na nyɛ̃ yɩ naa. Yɩ tɩ sɔɔl a be ber ata, bala wa lɩɛb wa baar, yɩn pãa tʋ̃ɔn chen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Ka a dɔɔr 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩn tun a polfʋ 'lɔ fʋn vɛ̃ ka sɩ pol kʋ fʋ. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a sɛɛ ɩka fʋ ɩ ala ɩ sɩ wa kpɛn jɛɛrɛ nɩ a fʋ paal. Lũ fɔ jɩɛ 'yɔ̃ɔ a tokoro 'lɔ pɔ fʋn vɛ̃ ka sɩ tu suu. Tara a fʋ sãa nɩ a fʋ mã, a fʋ yɛdɔɔr nɩ a fʋ sãa yir deme ba jaa waan a fʋ yir. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Ala ɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa wa yi naa a fʋ yir na wʋ wa kpi, wʋ yõ yele lɛ. Tɩchɛ nɩrɛ 'lɔ jaa na be a fʋ yir pɔ wa nyɛ̃ yele na ɩ naa a sɩ yele. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Tɩchɛ, ala ɩ fʋ wa tɩ gar kʋ nɩrɛ jaa a lɛ sɩn waara ɩka sɩ wa ɩ, sɩ mɩ kʋ̃ tu a lɛ fʋn vɛ̃ ka a sɩ pol kʋ fʋ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Ka wʋ sɔɔ de a lɛ ban 'yɛr tɩ vɛ̃ ka ba chen. Wʋ lũn a fɔ jɩɛ a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ ban wa chen baar 'yɔ̃ɔ a tokoro pɔ.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Ba tɩ sɔɔl be a tɔ̃ɔ ju. A nãa nɩbɛ yↄbɔ ban a tẽe lõbobo a jaa tɩ tan ber ata tɩ baa nyɛ̃ ba ɛ, ka ba lɩɛb wa a Jɛrɩko. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Ka a nɩjʋʋrbɔ ayi bala pãa lɩɛb suu a tɔ̃ɔ ju tɩ gɔ̃ɔ a man lɩɛb chen a Josʋwa sɛ̃. Ba 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa a bon 'lɔ jaa na ɩ. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Be lɛ ba 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩ bɔ̃ɔn ɩka a Nãaŋmɩn kʋ sɩn a paal wʋ jaa. Dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛn a nɩbɛ ba jaa a tẽe pɔ a sɩ jũu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">A Isɩral Nɩbɛ Na Gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan Man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />A wɛr na wa chaar, Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa dɔ̃ɔn na 'yirfʋ bibio yi be a ba jaa-jie a Sitim chen be a Jɔɔdan man pↄ tɩ jɛ̃ chɛlɛ a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ ban na wa gɔ̃ɔ. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />A ber ata puor, a nidierbe kpɛn yɔ a nɩbɛ jaa-jie <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />tɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩn wa nyɛ̃ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo ka ba wa tuo a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka, yɩ 'yir turo ba. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Yɩn ba bɔ̃ɔ a jie jũu, ban wiil yɩn a sɔr ka yɩ chen. Tɩchɛ yɩ taa wa gbʋrɔ a nɛbõ'yen daka ɛ, yɩ ara jãa wʋ gbɛɛ gãanfʋ tur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ chɔɔr yɩ mɩ̃ɛ chɛchɛ bojũu wɛr wa chaar, a Nãaŋmɩn na tʋ̃n nɛkõ-tʋ̃mɔ̃ a yɩ pɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ de a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka den a nɩbɛ nie.&gt;&gt; Ka ba maal nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn 'yɛr.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Dɩna, N na 'mɔɔ fʋ naa ka fʋ nyɛ̃ 'yɔ̃ɔfʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa niem, be lɛ ban bɔ̃ɔ ɩka N be naa a fʋ sɛ̃ nɩtãa a lɛ N na dɔ̃ɔ be a Mosesɩ sɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />'Yɛr kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka ɩka, bala wa ta a Jɔɔdan man kõkoor, yɩ kpɛ a man pɔ bɩlãa tɩ ara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ wa chɛl a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr bie. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />A nɩtɔ̃ lɛ yɩn bɔ̃ɔ ɩka a Ŋmɩn ben a yɩ sɛ̃, wʋn diin a Keena nɩbɛ nɩ a Heeti nɩbɛ nɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ nɩ a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Gɛrɩgasɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ bar. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Yɩ nyɛ̃, a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka na ɩ a wɛr wʋ jaa Ŋmɩn sofʋ na de yɩn nie tɩ gɔ̃ɔn a Jɔɔdan man. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />A lɛ, 'yir dɔɔr pie nɩ ayi yin a Isɩral bʋrɔ pɔ, ka a daba jaa ma yɩ a bʋrɔ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a wɛr wʋ jaa Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka na wa kpɛ a kʋ̃ɔ pɔ, a Jɔɔdan man na ŋmãan kʋ lɛ joro ɛ, ka a kʋ̃ɔ na yire a tẽe kaal lɔ̃ɔ taar jibõ'yen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa 'yir a ba jaa-jie na gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan man, a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka lɛ de ba a nie. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Kɔb bomo chɛfʋ sɔ̃ɔ jaa, a Jɔɔdan man ma paalaa. Tɩchɛ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka gbɛɛ na wa sɩɩr a Jɔɔdan man kʋ̃ɔ, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />ka a kɔ̃-sɛbɛ ŋmaa ba lɛ joro ɛ, na a kaal lɔ̃ɔ taa jibõ'yen gbĩgbĩn kaar a tẽe ban bʋɔlɔ Adama na gbʋr a Sarɩtan lõboor. A kʋ̃ɔ ŋmaa naa ba lɛ joro suro be a Nyaar mandal pɔ go ɛ, ka a nɩbɛ gɔ̃ɔ tor a Jɛrɩko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka ara na a wɛr kõo pɔ a Jɔɔdan man sãlsↄↄ, tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na wa tu a wɛr kõo pɔ gɔ̃ɔ.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yel Tɩɛraa Kʋsɩbɛ Ban Ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na wa gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan man baar, a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />&lt;&lt;'Yir dɔɔr pie nɩ ayi yin a Isɩral bʋrɔ pɔ, ka a daba jaa ma yi a bʋrɔ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa pɔ, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />na fʋ vɛ̃ ka ba wob kʋsɩbɛ pie nɩ ayi yin a jie 'lɔ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo na dɔ̃ɔ ara a Jɔɔdan man sãlsↄↄ. 'Yɛr kʋ ba ɩka ba chiin a kʋsɩbɛ anyãna tɩ bin a jie 'lɔ ban na tɩ gã a dɩna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Be lɛ ka Josʋwa pãa bʋɔl a nɩbɛ pie nɩ ayi bala wʋn 'yir <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />na wʋ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ kpɛ a Jɔɔdan man pɔ chen a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka niem, a yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa wʋ 'mↄↄ kʋsɩr dↄↄl a wʋ bↄↄ ju, ka a yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ara kʋ a Isɩral bʋrɔ. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />A kʋsɩbɛ anyãna na ɩ naa yel tɩɛraa kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ a bon 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na maal. Ala ɩ a yɩ bibiir wa sʋʋr yɩn daar kɔ̃ɔ, a bon 'lɔ 'yɔ̃ɔ yɩn chɔɔr a kʋsɩbɛ anyãna bin, <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />yɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na gɔ̃ɔnɔ a Jɔɔdan man nɩ a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka, wʋ var ɩ tẽ kõo ka ba gɔ̃ɔ. A kʋsɩbɛ anyãna na ma ɩ naa yel tɩɛraa sɔ̃ɔ jaa kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ a bon 'lↄ na ɩ a Jɔɔdan man pɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />A dↄↄr tun a Josʋwa nɛɛ nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Josʋwa, ba wob a kʋsɩbɛ pie nɩ ayi yin a be a Jɔɔdan man sãlsↄↄ, ka bõ'yen jaa ara kʋ a Isɩral bʋrɔ. Ba chiin yaa naa be a ba jaa-jie tɩ bin. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Josʋwa mɩ chɔɔr a kʋsɩbɛ pie nɩ ayi bin be a Jɔɔdan man sãlsↄↄ, be a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo na dɔ̃ɔ tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka ara nɩ. (A kʋsɩbɛ ala chɛnɛ na be be wa tɩ tan a dɩna.)<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo ara na be a Jɔɔdan man sãlsↄↄ tɩ tan a sↄↄ 'lↄ a anyã a jaa na wa tɩ ɩ baar, nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka wʋ 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ɩka ba ɩ. Lɛ lɛ a Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 4:10">A nɩbɛ pↄↄn gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan man gɔ̃ɔn. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a ba jaa na wa be a Jɔɔdan man gɔ̃ɔn, A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo na tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka den a nɩbɛ nie. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />A dↄↄr bala na ɩ a Wuruben nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ bamine na chↄↄr gu a jɛɛr den a nɩbɛ nie nɩtãa lɛ a Mosesɩ na 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka ba ɩ. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Be a Nãaŋmɩn niem, jɛjɛɛrbɛ nɩ na ta turo lɩjaayi na chↄↄr na jɛb lɛ gɔ̃ɔ a ji-chãa 'lↄ na gbʋr a Jɛrɩko.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />A daar 'lɔnɔ Nãaŋmɩn maal Josʋwa ka wʋ ɩ nidier a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa niem. Ba 'yɔ̃ɔnɔ wʋ naa tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ wʋn kpi, nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ 'yɔ̃ɔnɔ a Mosesɩ.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Be lɛ ka a Nãaŋmɩn pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />&lt;&lt;'Yɛr kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka ɩka, ba wa yi a Jɔɔdan man pↄ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Be lɛ ka Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ wa yi a Jɔɔdan man pɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo na wa do a man gogoro ju, a kʋ̃ↄ lɛ piel joro na wʋ paal.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />A nɩbɛ gɔ̃ɔn a Jɔɔdan man a ŋmɛr dɔ̃ɔ ber pie daar, na ba tɩ jɛ̃ a Gilgal na ɩ a Jɛrɩko mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Be lɛ ka Josʋwa de a kʋsɩbɛ pie nɩ ayi ala ban yin a Jɔɔdan man pↄ na wʋ ba. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Wʋ 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ala ɩ a yɩ bibiir wa sʋʋr yɩn daar kɔ̃ɔ, a bon 'lɔ 'yɔ̃ɔ yɩn chɔɔr a kʋsɩbɛ anyãna bin, <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />yɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na gɔ̃ɔnɔ a Jɔɔdan man, wʋ var ɩ tẽ kõo ka ba gɔ̃ɔ. <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Yɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃n ka a Jɔɔdan man var ko tɩ tan a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩn wa tɩ gɔ̃ɔ, nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ vɛ̃ ka a mandal jɩɛ 'lↄ var ɩ tẽ kõo kʋ sɩ. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />A nɩtɔ̃ jũu, nɩrɛ jaa na be a wɛr pↄ na bɔ̃ɔ naa a Nãaŋmɩn kpɛ̃ↄ, be lɛ yɩn 'yɔ̃ↄnↄ a yɩ Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn chiini sɔ̃ɔ nɩ sɔ̃ɔ jaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="s1">A Yɔɛ Ŋmafʋ Be A Gilgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />A Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine ba jaa na be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, nɩ a Keena nãmine ba jaa na be a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal lõboor wõn ɩka, a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃n ka a Jɔɔdan man ko tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa gɔ̃ɔ. Dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ ba naa ka a ba ɩ̃gan chʋɔr a Isɩral nɩbɛ jũu.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;De kʋsɩbɛ maal ka a ɩ sↄbil ka fʋ ŋman a Isɩral nɩbɛ yↄɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />A Josʋwa tu naa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr, na wʋ ŋma a Isɩral nɩbɛ yↄɛ a be ban bʋɔlɔ a yↄɛ ŋmafʋ tɔ̃ɔ ju.<verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4-6" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa yire a Ijipitɩ, ka ba ŋman a dabil ba jaa yↄɛ. Tɩchɛ a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na vire yʋɔrɔ a yuomo lɩjaayi na gɔ̃ɔ a dãlpʋɔ, a ba dabile ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba ŋmaa yʋɔr ɛ. A lɛ puor, a dɔɔr bala na ta jɛɛr jɛfʋ ban yin a Ijipitɩ paal pɔ waan kpi naa bojũu ba tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ. Nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ pɔ, waa vɛ̃ ka ba nyɛ̃ a wɛr 'lɔ na vɩɛlɛ tɩ tara pʋɔr wʋn pol kʋ a ba sãakpãmine ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 5:4-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Bojũu a nɩbɛ banyãna ba dɔ̃ɔ ŋma a bibiir yↄɛ ɛ, a bibiir banyãna yↄɛ lɛ a Josʋwa ŋma. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />A yↄɛ ŋmafʋ na wa baar, a nɩbɛ ba jaa ba tʋ̃ɔ chen jie jaa ɛ, ba jɛ̃n a ba jaa-jie tɩ tan a ba yↄɛ na wa 'mãa.<verse eid="JOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Dɩna N 'yir yɩn yin a Ijipitɩ yɩn dɔ̃ɔ be ɩ a gbãgbaar dire a vĩ.&gt;&gt; Ala lɛ so ka ba bʋɔlɔ a jie Gilgal, a yuor 'lↄ lɛ ba chɛnɛ bʋɔlɔ wa tan a dɩna.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na chɛnɛ jɩnɛ a Gilgal, a ji-chãa 'lↄ na gbʋr a Jɛrɩko, ba din a ba golbar difʋ a ŋmɛraa a wʋ ber pie nɩ anaar daar jãanʋɔr. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />A wɛr na wa chaar lɛ ɩ a bibir dɔ̃ɔ ban di a bʋ̃diir ala na be a Keena, a bʋ̃bie ban sɛ̃ nɩ a paanʋ̃ɔ ban ba 'yɔ̃ↄ dãbɩl ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ, a bʋ̃diir ala ban bʋɔlɔ a Maana ba lɛ loro ɛ, ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba lɛ nyɛrɛ yaa go ɛ. An yi a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ, ba dire na a bonsɩ ala na be a Keena wɛr pɔ.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Josʋwa Na Nyɛ̃ Daba Na Tara Sɔkpɛ̃ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Josʋwa na gbʋrɔ a Jɛrɩko, a dẽdẽedaa lɛ wʋ nyɛ̃ daba na ara a wʋ niem tara sɔkpɛ̃ɛ. Ka a Josʋwa tↄↄ ta sʋʋr wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Fʋ ɩ naa a sɩ jɛjɛɛrbɛ ɩ̃sʋɔ bɩɩ a sɩ dɔ̃dɔ̃mɔ̃ ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ fʋ ɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Ka a daba 'yɛr sɔɔ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;N ba ɩ a ba ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ɛ, maa lɛ ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn jɛjɛɛrbɛ nɩkpɛ̃ɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 5:14">Ka a Josʋwa lo kpa nie tẽe nɩ 'yɔ̃ɔfʋ tɩ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;N ɩ naa a fʋ tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ, bo lɛ fʋ bʋↄrↄ ɩka n ɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn jɛjɛɛrbɛ nɩkpɛ̃ɛ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yaar a fʋ nafↄbↄ bar, fʋ ara naa jie na ɩ chɛchɛ. Ka a Josʋwa tu a lɛ wʋn 'yɛr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">A Jɛrɩko Tẽe Na Lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />A Jɛrɩko pãmã pãa pↄↄ naa tɩchɛ ka ba gu lɛ an na ɩ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ kʋ tʋ̃ɔ kpɛ ɛ. Nɩrɛ jaa kʋ tʋ̃ɔ kpɛ a tẽe pↄ bɩɩ yi ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;N diere na a Jɛrɩko nɩ a wʋ nãmine nɩ a jɛjɛ-gãndaar ba jaa kʋrↄ fʋ. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Fʋ̃ʋ nɩ a fʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ yɩ ma chen gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛ bõ'yen bibir jaa tɩ tan ber ayʋↄb. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo ayopõi, ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa na tara ɩɩl na chen tɩ ara a nɛbõ'yen daka niem. A ber ayopõi daar, fʋ̃ʋ nɩ a fʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ na chen gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛɛ ayopõi tɩchɛ ka Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo pɛɛlɛ a wɛrsɩ. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Bala wa pɛɛl pɛɛlfʋ 'lↄ na kor jaa, yɩn wa wõ a lɛ, a nɩbɛ ba jaa ba ŋme chɛlma ka a tẽe dachine lo. Ka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ pãa kpɛ a tẽe pↄ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Ka a Josʋwa bʋɔl a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ 'mↄↄ a nɛbõ'yen daka, ka a yɩ ayopõi tara a wɛrsɩ den a nie.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Ka wʋ vɛ̃ ka a nɩbɛ gʋↄrↄ a tẽe, tɩchɛ ka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ de a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo bala na tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka nie.<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Nɩtãa a lɛ a Josʋwa na 'yɛr kʋ ba, a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo ayopõi na tara a wɛrsɩ den nie pɛɛlɛ a wɛrsɩ, ka a bala na tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka turo. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo bala na tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka be a puor, tɩchɛ ka a dɔɔr bala na tara a tã-jɛb bonsɩ lɛ turo a nɛbõ'yen daka puor. A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ wʋ jaa ka ba pɛɛlɛ na a wɛrsɩ. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Tɩchɛ ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ taa wa ŋmiere chɛlma ɛ, yɩ taa wa haara nɛɛ tɩ tan wʋn wa tɩr sↄr ɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Be lɛ ba tuo a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛ bõ'yen. Tɩ lɩɛb wa gã be a ba jaa-jie.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Ka a Josʋwa dɔ̃ɔn 'yirfʋ a bibio, ka a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo lɛ de a nɛbõ'yen daka tuo. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo ayopõi bala na tara a wɛrsɩ ayopõi den a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka nie pɛɛlɛ a wɛrsɩ. Tɩchɛ ka a dɔɔr bala na tara a tã-jɛb bonsɩ de a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka nie tɩ ka a bamine mɩ turo a puor. A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ wʋ jaa ba pɛɛlɛ naa a wɛrsɩ. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />A ber ayi sʋↄ, ba lɛ gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛ bõ'yen tɩ lɛ lɩɛb chen a ba jaa-jie. Ba ɩ naa a lɛ tɩ tan ber ayʋↄb.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />A ber ayopõi daar, ba 'yir naa a wɛr na wa chaar gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛɛ ayopõi, nɩtãa a lɛ ban ma dɔ̃ɔ gʋↄr, a bibir 'lɔ tɛɛ lɛ ba gʋↄr a tẽe gbɛɛ ayopõi. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />A gbɛɛ ayopõi sʋↄ, a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo na gbʋrɔ na pɛɛl a wɛrsɩ, ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ka ba ŋme chɛlma tɩ na wʋ 'yɛr, &lt;&lt;A Nãaŋmɩn de naa a tẽe kʋ yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Yɩ sɔ̃ɔ bon jaa na be a tẽe pɔ nɩ a tẽe wʋ jaa bar, ka a ɩ loraa kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn. A pↄↄ sɛ̃sɛ̃nɛ Wʋrahab tɛɛ lɛ sɛɛn vɛ̃ kʋfʋ bojũu wʋ sↄↄl a sɩ nɩjʋʋrbↄ bar. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Tɩchɛ yɩ taa wa diere bon 'lɔ jaa an sɛɛ ɩka yɩ sɔ̃ɔ bar ɛ, yɩn wa ɩ a lɛ, yɩn waan yele nɩ sɔ̃ɔfʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ jaa-jie. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Bon 'lↄ jaa ban de kpãna bɩɩ sɛlma bɩɩ kur-jɩɛ bɩɩ kur-tɩɩr maal ɩ naa a Nãaŋmɩn bon. A sɛɛn ɩka yɩ de 'yɔ̃ɔ a Nãaŋmɩn bomo pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlorobo pɛɛl a wɛrsɩ. A nɩbɛ na wa wõ a wɛrsɩ kõn, ba ŋmen chɛlsɩ ka a dachine lo. Ka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa pãa kpɛ sɔ̃ɔ a tẽe bar. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Ba den a ba sɔbɛrɛ kʋn a nɩbɛ ba jaa a tẽe pↄ, dↄↄr nɩ a pↄbↄ, bibiir nɩ a nɩnyↄn. Ba mɩ kʋn a niin nɩ a piir nɩ a bʋ̃n.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa 'yɛr kʋ a dɔɔr ayi bala na ɩ a nɩjʋʋrbↄ bala ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ kpɛ tɩ vɛ̃ ka a pↄↄ sɛ̃sɛ̃nɛ Wʋrahab nɩ a wʋ yir deme yi nɩtãa a lɛ yɩn dɔ̃ɔ pol kʋ wʋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Ka ba kpɛ tɩ vɛ̃ ka a Wʋrahab nɩ a wʋ sãa nɩ a wʋ mã, a wʋ yɛdɔɔr nɩ a wʋ yir deme ba jaa ka ba yi, ka ba tara ba chiin a ba tɩ jɛ̃ gbʋr a Isɩral nɩbɛ jaa-jie.<verse eid="JOS 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Tɩ na ba pãa chʋm bũu 'yɔ̃ↄ a tẽe wʋ jaa ka wʋ di, nɩ bon jaa na be a tẽe pↄ tɩ bar a bomo ala ban de sɛlma bɩɩ kpãna bɩɩ kur-jɩɛ bɩɩ kur-tɩɩr maal, ala lɛ ba de tɩ bin a be ban ma bine a Nãaŋmɩn bomo. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Tɩchɛ ka Josʋwa pãa kaa a pↄↄ sɛ̃sɛ̃nɛ Wʋrahab nɩ a wʋ nɩbɛ ba jaa nɩbaal, bojũu wʋ dɔ̃ɔ sↄↄl a nɩjʋʋrbↄ ayi bala wʋn dɔ̃ɔ tʋ̃ be a Jɛrɩko. (A wʋ yↄn ben a Isɩral wa tan a dɩna.)<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ, a Josʋwa pɔn 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Nɩrɛ 'lↄ jaa na wa bↄ ɩka wʋ lɛ mɛ a Jɛrɩko tẽe na nyɛ̃n Nãaŋmɩn pↄ 'yɔ̃ↄfʋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">&lt;&lt;Nɩrɛ 'lↄ jaa na wa kpar a Jɛrɩko dachin pielaa bida-kpɛ̃ɛ na kpi naa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">ka nɩrɛ 'lↄ jaa na wa mɛ a dɔ̃dɔr nɛɛ bidabile mɩ na kpi naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn be a Josʋwa sɛ̃, ka a wʋ yuor yaar de a paal wʋ jaa.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">A Ekan Na Maal Dɛɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ tↄr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ wʋn tɩr ɩka ba taa diere bon jaa na sɛɛ ɩka ba sɔ̃ɔ bar be a Jɛrɩko ɛ. Tɩchɛ daba kɔ̃ɔ yuor ban bʋɔlɔ Ekan lɛ tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ, a lɛ vɛ̃ naa ka a Nãaŋmɩn suur 'yir a Isɩral nɩbɛ. (Ekan na ɩ Karmɩ bidaba na ɩ Sabdi yɔ̃ɔ na yi a Sera dɔ̃dɔr pɔ, na ɩ a Juda bʋrɔ.)<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Be lɛ a Josʋwa tʋ̃ a wʋ dↄↄr bamine yin be a Jɛrɩko, ka ba chen a Ayi, a tẽe na be a Bɛtɩl mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie na gbʋr a Bɛtavɛn ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ tɩ jʋʋr a paal kaa.&gt;&gt; Ba chen tɩ jʋʋr a Ayi wɛr kaa.<verse eid="JOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ ban wa lɩɛb wa a Josʋwa sɛ̃, ba 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;A ba sɛɛ ɩka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa ba chen tɩ jɛb a Ayi nɩbɛ ɛ. 'Yir jɛjɛɛrbɛ turo ayi bɩɩ turo ata tɛɛ ka ba tɩ jɛb ba, ta vɛ̃ ka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa chen tɩ jɛb ba ɛ, bojũu a tẽe ba bɛr ma ɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛjɛɛrbɛ turo ata chen na tɩ jɛb ba, tɩchɛ ka a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine tʋ̃ↄ ba a ba lɩɛb jo. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />A Ayi dↄↄr dii ban yin be a tẽe dɔ̃dɔr nɛɛ, tɩ tan a kʋsɩbɛ ŋmɛrfʋ jie, tɩchɛ ka ba kʋ nɩbɛ lɩjɛr nɩ pie nɩ ayʋↄb be a tɔ̃ɔ par. Ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩ̃gama pãa chʋɔr ka a dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ ba.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛrɛ tↄↄ naa a ba bosusɩ chɩɛr nɩ pʋsɔ̃ɔ, na ba gãn be a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka niem, ba gãn a be tɩ tan a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ na wa mʋr, na ba ɔ̃ɔ tan 'yɔ̃ɔ a ba jur pɔ wile a ba nɩbaal. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;N Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn, bo lɛ vɛ̃ ka fʋ gɔ̃ɔn sɩ a Jɔɔdan man de sɩ wa kʋ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ ɩka ba sɔ̃ɔ sɩ bar? Bo lɛ so ka faa vɛ̃ ka sɩ kpɩɛrɛ be a Jɔɔdan man gɔ̃ɔn ɛ? <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Nãaŋmɩn, bo lɛ n na lɛ 'yɛr, a pʋ̃pãanyã a Isɩral nɩbɛ dɔ̃dɔ̃mine na ben tʋ̃ↄ ba? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />A keena nɩbɛ nɩ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na be a paal 'lɔ pɔ na wõn a yele nyã, na ba ŋmaa jil sɩ na ba kʋ sɩ jaa. Bo lɛ fʋn pãa ɩ ka ba 'yɔ̃ɔnɔ a fʋ yuor?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;'Yir! bo lɛ so fʋn gã a tẽe a lɛ? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ maal dɛɛr! Ba tɔr a nɛbõ'yen 'lɔ N na ɩn ba. Ba den a bonsɩ ala amine an sɛɛ ɩka ba ta sɔ̃ɔ bar. Ba jun amine, na ba ŋma jie, na ba maal yaa ka a ɩ a ba bonsɩ. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ala lɛ so ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba tʋ̃ɔ jɛb a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ɛ. A ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine dii ba naa a ba jo bojũu a ba mɩ̃ɛ sɛɛn sɔ̃ɔ bar fʋ. N kʋ lɛ be yɩ sɛ̃ go ɛ, tɩ tan a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩn na wa sɔ̃ɔ a bomo ala N na 'yɛr kʋ yɩ ɩka yɩ taa wa diere ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />'Yir! chↄↄr a nɩbɛ na fʋ vɛ̃ ka ba wa a N niem. 'Yɛr kʋ ba ka ba chↄↄr gu ma a bio bojũu, a maa na ɩ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn tara naa 'yɛr na 'yɛr kʋ yɩ, &lt;Isɩral, yɩ tara naa bonsɩ amine N na 'yɛr ɩka yɩ sɔ̃ɔ bar a yɩ pↄ. Yɩn kʋ tʋ̃ɔ jɛb a yɩ dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ka yɩn baa wa de a bonsɩ ala sɔ̃ɔ bar ɛ.&gt; <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />A lɛ juu, 'yɛr kʋ ba, wɛr wa chaar bibio, ban wan a N niem. A bʋrɔ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba wa a N niem, bʋrɔ 'lɔ jaa N na wa 'yir lɛ na wa a N niem dɔ̃dɔr ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa. Dɔ̃dɔr 'lↄ jaa N na wa 'yir lɛ na wa a N niem nɩ wʋ yie deme. Yir 'lↄ jaa N na wa 'yir lɛ na wa a N niem nɩ a wʋ dɔɔr, ka a dɔɔr pãa waara a N sɛ̃ bõ'yen 'yen. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Nɩrɛ 'lↄ jaa sɛ̃ a bomo anyã na wa be, ban chʋm 'lↄ nɩ a wʋ yir deme nɩ a wʋ bʋ̃tarsɩ bojũu wʋ 'yɔ̃ɔn a Isɩral nɩbɛ vĩ na wʋ sɔ̃ɔ a N nɛbõ'yen!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />A wɛr na wa chaar bibio pipi, Josʋwa lɔ̃ↄn taa a Isɩral nɩbɛ bʋrɔ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa waan a Nãaŋmɩn niem, ka a wʋ 'yir a Juda bʋrɔ. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Be lɛ wʋ waan a Juda bʋrɔ dɔ̃dɔr ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa a niem, ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yir a Sera dɔ̃dɔr. Ka wʋ lɛ waan a Sera dɔ̃dɔr a niem yir ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa. Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yir a Sabdi yir deme. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Ka wʋ pãa waan a Sabdi yir deme bõ'yen 'yen a niem, ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yir a Ekan na ɩ Karmɩ bidaba na ɩ Sabdi yɔ̃ↄ.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;N bie, 'yɛr sɩrɛ a kana a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ Ŋmɩn niem, tɩ na fʋ chiir a fʋ pʋↄ. 'Yɛr kʋ ma a bon 'lↄ fʋn ɩ. Ta de sↄↄl ma ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Ka a Ekan 'yɛr, &lt;&lt;Sɩrɛ jaa lɛ, n maal dɛɛr a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ Ŋmɩn niem, a dɛɛr n na maal nɩ nyã. <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />A bonsɩ ala sɩn fa, n nyɛ̃n a Babilↄn nɩrɛ ɩ̃sʋɔ fuu na vɩɛlɛ nɩ kpãna nɩ sɛldaa a manfʋ nɩ na ɩ chɩlo ayi nɩ bʋ̃ ŋmãa, ka n bʋↄrↄ yaa yɔɔ jaa, na n wob. N ũu yaa na bar a be a n fɔbaa yir, ka a kpãna be a par.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Ka a Josʋwa tʋ̃ a nɩbɛ bamine ka ba jo chen a fɔbaa yir tɩ kaa ka a ɩ sɩrɛ, a bomo ũun be a fɔbaa yir ka a kpãna be a par. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Ka ba wɛl yaa yin a be a wʋ fɔbaa yir tɩ wiil a Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa tɩ na ba de bin a Nãaŋmɩn niem.<verse eid="JOS 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa nyɔɔn a Ekan tɩ fa a kpãna, a fuu nɩ a sɛlma nɩ a Ekan bidↄↄr nɩ a bipↄbↄ, nɩ a wʋ niin, nɩ a wʋ bʋ̃n nɩ a piir, nɩ a wʋ fɔbaa yir nɩ a wʋ bʋ̃tarsɩ a jaa tɩ na ba tara wʋ chiin be a dↄↄrfʋ baa pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Bo lɛ vɛ̃ ka fʋ de a dↄↄrfʋ nyã waan a sɩ pↄ.&gt;&gt; Nãaŋmɩn mɩ na dↄↄrfʋ naa. Ka a nɩbɛ ba jaa pãa lↄb a Ekan nɩ kʋsɩbɛ kʋ, ba mɩ lɛ lↄb a wʋ yir deme kʋ tɩ chʋm a wʋ bʋ̃tarsɩ.<verse eid="JOS 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Ba wob kʋsɩbɛ dↄↄl pɔɔ a Ekan, ka a chɛnɛ be be wa tan a dɩna. Ala lɛ so ka ba bʋɔlɔ a jie dↄↄrfʋ baa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:26">Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn suur pãa lo.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">A Isɩral Nɩbɛ Na Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ A Ayi Nɩbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Be lɛ ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ta joro dãbɩ̃ɛ bɩɩ ta vɛ̃ ka a ɩ̃gan chʋɔr fʋ ɛ. Tara a fʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa chiin be a Ayi. Bojũu N de naa a Ayi na N kʋ fʋ nɩ a wʋ nãa nɩ a wʋ nɩbɛ nɩ a wʋ wɛr. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Yɩ maal a Ayi nãa nɩtãa a lɛ yɩn dɔ̃ɔ maal a Jɛrɩko nãa, tɩchɛ pʋ̃pãanyã 'lɔ, yɩ de a ba bʋ̃tarsɩ nɩ a ba dʋn ka a ɩ a yɩ sofʋ. Yɩ chↄↄr tu a tẽe puor tɩ dũu jɛb ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Ka a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ chen na tɩ jɛb a Ayi nɩbɛ. Wʋ 'yir a jɛjɛ-kpɩ̃ɛn turo lɩjɛr nɩ pie tʋ̃ ba tɩ̃sɔɔ <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />nɩ a kpãafʋ 'yɛrbie anyãna ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ tɩ sↄↄl a tẽe puor, yɩ taa wa jãan a tẽe yɔɔ ɛ, na yɩ chↄↄr gu na jɛb ba. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Maa nɩ a n nɩbɛ bamine na kpɛ naa a tẽe pↄ, bala wa 'yir tɩɛ sɩ, sɩn lɩɛb joro nɩtãa a lɛ sɩn dɔ̃ɔ de nie ɩ. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Ban joro na turo sɩ tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ sɩn wa bɛl ba yin a tẽe pↄ. Ban tɩɛr ɩka sɩ lɛ joro naa nɩtãa a lɛ sɩn dɔ̃ɔ jo. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Ka yɩ pãa 'yir a jiir ala yɩn sↄↄl tɩ jɛb a tẽe. A yɩ Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn na de naa a tẽe kʋ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Yɩn wa tʋ̃ↄ a tẽe wa baar, yɩ chʋm bũu 'yɔ̃ↄ, nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan yɩ. Anyãna lɛ sɛɛ ɩka yɩ ɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa vɛ̃ ka ba chen, na ba tɩ sↄↄl a ba sↄↄlfʋ jiir chɛlɛ ba a be Ayi mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, a Ayi nɩ a Bɛtɩl chara pↄ. Tɩchɛ ka a Josʋwa gã be a ba jaa-jie a tɩ̃sɔɔ 'lɔnɔ.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />A wɛr na wa chaar bibio, ka a Josʋwa 'yir bʋɔl a jɛjɛɛrbɛ lɔ̃ↄ taa. Ka a 'lↄ nɩ a Isɩral nidierbe de ba nie chiin ba a be a Ayi. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />A jɛjɛɛrbɛ bala na 'mãtaa chiin wʋ, chen be a tẽe niem na ba tɩ maal a ba jaa-jie a be a sa-par dɩr jie, ka a baa be a bala nɩ a Ayi chara pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Wʋ 'yir dↄↄr turo anũu ka ba sↄↄl be a tẽe mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie a Bɛtɩl nɩ a Ayi chara pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Wʋ vɛ̃n ka ba ŋma gbulsɩ na jɛb ba, ka ba yↄↄ ara be a sa-par dɩr jie tɩchɛ ka a bamine mɩ ara be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie. Tɩchɛ ka a Josʋwa gã be a baa pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />A Ayi nãa na wa nyɛ̃ a Josʋwa nɩbɛ, wʋ lɔ̃ↄn taa a wʋ nɩbɛ fↄↄ jaa. 'Lↄ nɩ a wʋ nɩbɛ yin tor a Jɔɔdan baa lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ nɩ tɩ jɛb a Isɩral nɩbɛ, nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ jɛb ba a be, tɩchɛ baa bɔ̃ɔ ɩka a jɛjɛɛrbɛ sɔɔl gu ba a be a tẽe dãpuor ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ nɩbɛ bɛl lɩɛb joro nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ dii ba ka ba jo, na ba jo tor a dãlpʋɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Ba bʋɔl a Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa lɔ̃ↄ taa ka ba dire ba, a lɛ ban dire a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ nɩbɛ, ka ba jo yi jãan a tẽe. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />A Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa yin turo a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ tɩ bar a tẽe ka wʋ gã vuo, nɩrɛ ba lɛ be be na jɛb kʋ a tẽe go ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;De a fʋ pĩi lɔraa tur a Ayi, N diere wʋn kʋrↄ fʋ.&gt;&gt; Ka a Josʋwa ɩ a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr, <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ wʋn wa 'mↄↄ a wʋ nũu tur, ka a wʋ nɩbɛ bala na sↄↄl vaa 'yir jo kpɛ a tẽe pↄ tɩ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a tẽe. Na ba chʋm bũu 'yɔ̃ↄ a tẽe pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ na wa lɩɛb kaa a ba puor, ka ba nyɛ̃ a jʋʋr na uro duoro a saaju. Ka sↄr ba be be ka ban lɛ faa a ba mɩ̃ɛ ɛ. Bojũu, a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ bala na jo tor a dãlpʋɔ lɩɛb tuor ba jɛɛrɛ nɩ ba. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ na wa bɔ̃ɔ ɩka a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ bala na kpɛ a tẽe pɔ chʋm a tẽe, ka ba pãa lɩɛb kʋrↄ a Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Ka a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ bala na dɔ̃ɔ kpɛ a Ayi tẽe pↄ yi pʋↄ ba ka ba jɛb a Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ. Ka a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ wa jil a Ayi jɛjɛɛrbɛ 'yɔ̃ɔ sãlsↄↄ na ba kʋ ba jaa. Ka a ba ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba tʋ̃ɔ jo faa wʋ mɩ̃ɛ ɛ, <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />ka a Ayi nãa tɛɛ ba lɛ ɛ. Ba nyↄↄ wʋn tɩ kʋ a Josʋwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />A Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ kʋn a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ba jaa a be a dãlpʋɔ ju, a be ban dɔ̃ɔ dii ba, na ba mɩ lɛ lɩɛb chen a Ayi tɩ kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25-26" />Josʋwa tur a wʋ pĩi lɔraa tor Ayi tẽe, na waa bin wʋ tẽe ɛ, tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ ban wa kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa. Ba kʋn a Ayi dↄↄr nɩ a pↄbↄ turo pie nɩ ayi (12,000) a daar 'lↄnↄ. <verse eid="JOS 8:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ pãa den a ba dʋn nɩ a ba bʋ̃tarsɩ ala ban jɛb fa nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dɔ̃ɔ 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Josʋwa chʋm a Ayi tẽe ka wʋ di. Wʋ chɛnɛ na kaara a lɛ wa tan a dɩna. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Wʋ yↄↄl a Ayi nãa tɩɛ ju tɩ tan a jãanʋɔr. A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ na wa mʋrɔ, ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr ka ba yↄↄ a wʋ ɩ̃gan tɩ lↄb bar a tẽe dɔ̃dɔr kpɛ̃ɛ par, tɩ na ba wob kʋsɩbɛ pɔɔ wʋ. Wʋ chɛnɛ na be be wa tan a dɩna.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Yelbinaa Ban Kar Be A Ɛbal Tɔ̃ɔ Ju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Ka a Josʋwa mɛ bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ Ŋmɩn a be a Ɛbal tɔ̃ɔ ju. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Wʋ mɛ wʋn nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na dɔ̃ɔ 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ a wʋ yelbinaa pↄ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ba de kʋsɩbɛ ban ba de kur ŋmãan ɛ, mɛn a bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo.&gt;&gt; Be lɛ ba ma chʋm a chʋm kʋ di loraa kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn, na ba mɩ lɛ waan a ba lɔ̃ɔ-taa loraa wa kʋ wʋ. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />A be a Isɩral nɩbɛ niem lɛ a Josʋwa sɛb a Mosesɩ yelbinsɩ ala wʋn dɔ̃ɔ sɛb 'yɔ̃ɔ a kʋsɩbɛ pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ nɩ a ba nidierbe nɩ a ba nɩbɛrɛ nɩ a ba 'yɛr tɔɔrbɔ nɩ a sãan-buro na be a ba pɔ, ara naa a Nãaŋmɩn nɛbõ'yen daka lõbobo a jaa ayi na ba tor a lɛvi nɩbɛ bɔɔrlorobo bala na tuo a nɛbõ'yen daka. A nɩbɛ ŋmãa ara na lɩɛb a ba puor 'yɔ̃ɔ a Gɛrisim tɔ̃ɔ, ka a ŋmãa bala mɩ na chɛ lɩɛb a ba puor 'yɔ̃ɔ Ɛbal tɔ̃ɔ. A Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔn kpãkpãan ba ɩka, ba maal a nɩtɔ̃ a sɔ̃ɔ wa ta ɩka ba de a bɩɛlfʋ.<verse eid="JOS 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa kar a yelbinsɩ a jaa lɔ̃ɔn a bɩɛlfʋ nɩ a pɔ'yɔ̃ɔfʋ nɩtãa a lɛ ban sɛb 'yɔ̃ɔ a yelbinsɩ gan pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Josʋwa kar a Mosesɩ yelbinsɩ kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na lɔ̃ɔ, 'mãtãan pↄbↄ nɩ a bibiir nɩ a sãan-buro bala na pʋↄ ba.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">A Gibiɔn Nɩbɛ Na Bɛl A Josʋwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />A nãmine bala na be a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, wõ naa a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔfʋ, a bala na be a tɔ̃n jur nɩ a tɔ̃n sɩɩr pↄ nɩ a bala na kpɩɛrɛ a ji-chãa na gbʋr a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal na tɩ ta a Lɛbanↄn sa-par dɩr jie. Bala lɛ ɩ a Heeti nɩbɛ nɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Keena nɩbɛ nɩ a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ nɩ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ nãmine. <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Ba jaa wa lɔ̃ↄn taa na jɛb a Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Tɩchɛ ka a Gibiɔn nɩbɛ na ɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ na wa wõ a lɛ a Josʋwa na dɔ̃ɔ maal a Jɛrɩko nɩ a Ayi <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />ka ba bʋɔrɔ ɩka ba bɛl wʋ. Ba tɩ bↄn bʋ̃diir na ba dɔɔl a ba bʋ̃n jur nɩ bɔtɔ koro nɩ dãwʋʋr koro. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Ba den bon jãrsɩ nɩ nafɔɔr koro ban sɛ su, ka a paanʋ̃ɔ ban tara chiin ko ul. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Na ba pãa chen be a ba jaa-jie be a Gilgal tɩ 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩ yin jie 'lↄ na jãa, sɩ bʋↄrↄ naa ɩka sɩ wa ka sɩ wa ɩ nɛbõ'yen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Tɩchɛ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ 'yɛr, &lt;&lt;Bo lɛ vɛ̃ ka sɩ na ɩn yɩ nɛbõ'yen? Amine a yɩ jie gbʋr sɩ naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Ka ba 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩ ɩ naa a fʋ tʋ̃tʋnbɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Ka a Josʋwa sʋʋr ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Nɩbaboo lɛ yɩ ɩ? Nyɩnɛ lɛ yɩ yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Ka ba 'yɛr a nɩtɔ̃ kʋ wʋ, &lt;&lt;Nɩkpɛ̃ɛ sɩ yin jie 'lↄ na jãa, sɩ wõn a fʋ Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn yele. Sɩ wõn a tʋ̃mɔ̃ 'lↄ jaa wʋn tʋ̃ be a Ijipitɩ, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />na sɩ mɩ lɛ wõ a lɛ wʋn maal a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine ayi be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie a Sihɔn na ɩ a Hɛsɩbↄn nãa nɩ a Ɔgi na ɩ Basan nãa na be a Asiterↄfʋ. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />A sɩ nidierbe nɩ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na kpɩɛrɛ a sɩ wɛr pɔ, ɩka sɩ bↄ bʋ̃diir lɛ an na ɩ ka sɩ tʋ̃ɔ wa nyɛ̃ fʋ. Ba 'yɛr naa ɩka sɩ wa ɩ a fʋ tʋ̃tʋnbɔ, na sɩ wa ɩn fʋ nɛbõ'yen. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Kaa a sɩ paanʋ̃ɔ, a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ sɩn yin yaa a yir waara nɩ a fʋ sɛ̃, a chɛnɛ na tʋlɔ. Tɩchɛ kaa, pʋ̃pãanyã a jaa wa kon ul. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ sɩn 'yɔ̃ɔ a dãa a wʋʋr anyã pɔ, wɔ paalaa lɛ, tɩchɛ pʋ̃pãanyã a ben chɩɛr. A sɩ bʋ̃sursɩ nɩ a sɩ nafↄbↄ lɩɛb bʋ̃jãrsɩ, a sɔr na jãa jũu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ sↄↄ de a ba bʋ̃diir amine, tɩchɛ baa sʋʋr 'yɛr yin a Nãaŋmɩn sɛ̃ ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Josʋwa ɩn naa a Gibiɔn nɩbɛ nɛbõ'yen ka ba ɩ barmine, na wʋ bar ba ka ba be be. A Isɩral tẽe nidierbe pol kʋ ba ɩka, ban tara naa a nɛbõ'yen.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Ban wa ɩ a nɛbõ'yen wa baar, a ber ata daar lɛ ba bɔ̃ɔn ɩka, ba yin jie 'lↄ na gbʋr. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Be lɛ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ 'yir de ber ata chiin tɩ ta a tẽn ala a nɩbɛ banyãna na kpɩɛrɛ, a Gibiɔn nɩ a Kefɩra nɩ a Bɛɛrↄfʋ nɩ a Kɩrɩyafʋ Jɛrɩyim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Tɩchɛ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ kʋ tʋ̃ɔ kʋ ba ɛ, bojũu a ba nidierbe den a Isɩral Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn yuor pol kʋ ba. A Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa pãa 'yɛr pʋsɔ̃ɔ 'yɛr kʋ a ba nidierbe nɩ a lɛ ban maal. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Tɩchɛ ka ba 'yɛr sɔɔ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩn ben de a Isɩral Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn yuor be pol kʋ ba, sɩ kʋ tʋ̃ɔ maal ba dɛɛr ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />A sɛɛ naa ɩka sɩ bar ba a ba be be sɩn pol kʋ ba jũu, sɩn ba ɩ a lɛ ɛ, Nãaŋmɩn na dↄↄr sɩ naa. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Yɩ vɛ̃ ka ba kpɩɛrɛ a ka tɩchɛ bala lɛ na ma ŋmara a sɩ daar na ba ɔ̃ɔnɔ nɩ a sɩ kɔ̃n.&gt;&gt; Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a nidierbe 'yɛr.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Ka a Josʋwa vɛ̃ ka ba tara a Gibiɔn nɩbɛ waan a wʋ sɛ̃, ka wʋ sʋʋr ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Bo lɛ so yɩn bɛlsɩ 'yɛr ɩka yɩ yin jijãan tɩchɛ ka a ɩ yɩ kpɩɛrɛ na gbʋr a ka? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />A nɩtɔ̃ yɩn ɩ jũu, a Ŋmɩn pↄn 'yɔ̃ↄ yɩ, a yɩ nɩbɛ na ɩn gbãgbaar sɔ̃ɔ jaa, na ba ma ŋmara daar tɩ ɔ̃ↄnↄ kɔ̃n waara nɩ a Ŋmɩn yir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Ka ba 'yɛr sɔɔ wʋ, &lt;&lt;Nɩkpɛ̃ɛ, sɩ maal a lɛ bojũu sɩ wõn ɩka sɩrɛ jaa a yɩ Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn dɔ̃ɔn kpãkpãan a wʋ tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ ɩka wʋ de a paal wʋ jaa kʋ yɩ, ka yɩ kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa na kpɩɛrɛ a wʋ pɔ a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ yɩn waara. Sɩ ɩ naa a lɛ bojũu pɩla ɔɔ sɩ naa a yɩ jũu, ka dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ sɩ a sɩ nyɛvʋɛ 'yɔ̃ɔ. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Pʋ̃pãanyã, sɩ ben a fʋ nuur pɔ, ɩ sɩ lɛ jaa fʋn tɩɛr na tor.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Josʋwa ɩ, wʋ gu ba naa na waa vɛ̃ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ kʋ ba ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Tɩchɛ a daar 'lɔnɔ wʋ maal ba naa ka ba ɩ gbãgbaar na ba ŋmara daar, tɩ ɔ̃ɔnɔ kʋ̃ↄ kʋrↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ nɩ a be a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na be. Ba chɛnɛ na tʋ̃nɔ a nɩtɔ̃ wa tan a dɩna a jie 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yir ka ba puoro wʋ.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">A Amɔrɩ Nɩbɛ Ban Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Adonɩsɛdɛkɩ na ɩ a Jɛrusalɛm nãa wõ naa ɩka a Josʋwa jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a Ayi nɩbɛ ba jaa, na wʋ kʋ a nãa nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ kʋ a Jɛrɩko nɩbɛ nɩ a ba nãa. Wʋ mɩ lɛ wõn ɩka a Gibiɔn nɩbɛ ɩn naa a Isɩral nɩbɛ nɛbõ'yen na ba kpɩɛrɛ nɩ ɩ̃gan 'maar. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Be lɛ a Jɛrusalɛm nɩbɛ pɩla ↄↄ yↄↄ jaa nɩ a lɛ na ɩ, bojũu Gibiɔn lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a paal 'lↄ na bɛrma jɩ̃ a paalsɩ ala na tara nãmine, wʋ dɔ̃ɔn bɛrma gar a Ayi tɩ mɩ lɛ tara nɩbɛ na bɔ̃ɔ jɛɛr. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Ka a Adonɩsɛdɛkɩ tɩr a nɛɛ nyã kʋ Hoham na ɩ Hɛbʋrↄn nãa nɩ a Pɩram na ɩ Jarmʋfʋ nãa nɩ a Jafɩya na ɩ a Lachisɩ nãa nɩ a Dɛbir na ɩ a Ɛgilↄn nãa. <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />&lt;&lt;Yɩ wa sʋ̃ʋ ma ka n jɛb tɩɛ a Gibiɔn, bojũu a wʋ nɩbɛ den a ba mɩ̃ɛ tɩ 'mãtãan a Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ka ba kpɩɛrɛ nɩ ɩ̃gan 'maar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />A Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine anũu banyãna, a Jɛrusalɛm nãa nɩ a Hɛbʋrↄn nãa nɩ a Jarmʋfʋ nãa nɩ a Lachisɩ nãa nɩ Ɛgilↄn nãa lɔ̃ɔn taa na ba tɩ jil pii a Gibiɔn.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Ka a Gibiɔn dↄↄr tʋ̃ 'yɛr a Josʋwa be a Gilgal ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ta tↄr sɩ bar ɛ nɩkpɛ̃ɛ, wa fↄↄ jaa wa faa sɩ! A Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine na be a tɔ̃n paal pɔ ba jaa lɔ̃ↄn taa wa pii sɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Ka a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa pʋↄn a jɛjɛɛrbɛ bala na bɔ̃ɔ jɛɛr, yi be a Gilgal chiini a Gibiɔn. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ta joro ba dãbɩ̃ɛ ɛ, N den nie kʋfʋ tʋ̃ɔfʋ. Ba ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa kʋ tʋ̃ɔ jɛb tɩɛ fʋ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />A tɩ̃sɔɔ gbul wʋ jaa, a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ yin a Gilgal chen be a Gibiɔn na ba tɩ dũu pii a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃ ka a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ pɩla ↄↄ ban wa nyɛ̃ a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ. A Isɩral nɩbɛ kʋ ban be a Gibiɔn tɩ dii a bamine yin a tɔ̃n jur suun be a Bɛfʋ Hↄrↄn, na ba jɛb ba jaa na ba tɩ tan a Asɩka nɩ a Makɩda sa-par gʋba jie. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ na wa joro yire a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ sɛ̃, a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃n ka sakpulõbie na bɛrɛ̃sɩ lo ŋme ba kʋ tɩ tan Asɩka. A bala a sakpulõbie na kʋ gar a bala a Isɩral jɛjɛɛrbɛ na kʋ.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />A daar 'lↄnɔ a Nãaŋmɩn na vɛ̃ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ, Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn a Isɩral nɩbɛ niem ɩka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">&lt;&lt;Mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ, ara a be a Gibiɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">ŋmɛraa, mɩ ara a Ayijalↄn baa pↄ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Ka a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">ka a ŋmɛraa mɩ ara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">tɩ tan a sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ ban wa jɛb tʋ̃ↄ a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">A anyãna sɛb be a Jasar gan pↄ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ ara na a gar ju sãlsↄↄ ba mʋr a bibir gbul wʋ jaa ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />A nɩtɔ̃ ba dɔ̃ɔ ɩ jaa ɛ, na a kʋ̃ mɩ lɛ wa ɩ jaa ɛ, Nãaŋmɩn na tu a nɩsaal nɛɛ na wʋ de a jɛɛr jɛb kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />A anyã puor, a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ lɩɛb chen a ba jaa-jie be a Gilgal.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Amɔrɩ Nɩbɛ Nãmine Anũu Ban Nyɔɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />A Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine anũu jon tɩ sↄↄl be a kʋsɩr bↄↄ pↄ be a Makɩda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Nɩrɛ ɩ̃sʋɔ nyɛ̃ ba naa na wʋ tɩ 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa a jie 'lↄ ban sↄↄl. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr, yɩ bil kʋsɩr kpɛ̃ɛ pↄↄ a bↄↄ nɛɛ, na yɩ 'yir nɩbɛ 'yɔ̃ɔ ka ba gu. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Tɩchɛ yɩn mɩ̃ɛ, yɩ ta ara a be ɛ. Yɩ chɛnɛ turo a yɩ dɔ̃dɔ̃mine, yɩ tɩ dũu jɛb ba be a puor, yɩ ta vɛ̃ ka ba kpɛ a ba tẽbɛrɛ pↄ ɛ, bojũu a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn jɛb tʋ̃ɔ ba kʋ yɩ.<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />A Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ kʋ ba naa tɩchɛ ka a bamine mɩ tʋ̃ɔ jo tɩ kpɛ a ba tẽn ala ban mɛ a dachine jil na ba faa a ba mɩ̃ɛ ka a baa kʋ ba ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Ka a Josʋwa jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa lɛ tʋ̃ɔ lɩɛb wa a ba jaa-jie be a Makɩda ka baa kʋ a ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:21">Nɩrɛ jaa na be a paal pɔ ba 'la 'yɛr 'yɛr tɩɛ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ yuo a kʋsɩr bɔɔ, tɩ tara a nãmine anũu bala wa kʋ ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Be lɛ ka ba yuo a kʋsɩr bɔɔ, tɩ tara a Jɛrusalɛm nɩ a Hɛbʋrↄn nɩ a Jarmʋfʋ nɩ a Lachisɩ nɩ a Ɛgilↄn nãmine yin <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />wa kʋ a Josʋwa. Ka Josʋwa pãa bʋɔl a Isɩral dↄↄr ba jaa wa lɔ̃ↄ taa, tɩ vɛ̃ a nɩbɛrɛ bala na lɔ̃ↄ chiin wʋ ka ba de a ba gbɛɛ dↄↄl a nãmine nyɩn ju, ka ba ɩ a lɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa 'yɛr kʋ a wʋ nɩbɛrɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ ta vɛ̃ ka a dãbɩ̃ɛ kʋrɔ yɩ ɛ, bɩɩ ka a yɩ ɩ̃gama chʋɔr ɛ. Yɩ ara kpɛ̃ɔ na yɩ nyↄↄ nyãa, bojũu a nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ kʋ a yɩ dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ba jaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa kʋ a nãmine anũu banyãna yɔɔl tɩɩr anũu ju, ka a ba ɩ̃gama yɔɔl a be tɩ tan jãanʋɔr.<verse eid="JOS 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ na wa mʋr, ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr ka ba yↄↄr ba tɩ lↄb 'yɔ̃ↄ a bↄↄ 'lↄ pↄ ban dɔ̃ɔ sↄↄl. Ba bil kʋsɩr bɛrɛ tɩ pↄↄ a bↄↄ nɛɛ, ka a chɛnɛ be be wa tɩ tan a dɩna.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Josʋwa Na Jɛb Fa A Amɔrɩ Nɩbɛ Tẽbɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />A daar 'lↄnↄ mɩ lɛ a Josʋwa tɩ pii a Makɩda tẽe na wʋ nyɔɔr ba nɩ a ba nãa. Wʋ kʋ naa a nɩbɛ ba jaa ka nɩrɛ jaa ba chɛ ɛ. Wʋ maal a Makɩda nãa nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn maal a Jɛrɩko nãa.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />A anyã puor, Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ yin be a Makɩda chen be a Libina na wʋ tɩ pii a tẽe. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn mɩ kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ kpɛ̃ɔ ka ba jɛb tʋ̃ↄ a tẽe nɩ a wʋ nãa. Baa bar nɩrɛ jaa a tẽe pɔ ɛ. Ba kʋn nɩrɛ jaa a tẽe pɔ. Ba maal a nãa nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ maal a Jɛrɩko nãa.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />A anyã puor, Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ yin be Libina chen a Lachisɩ, na ba tɩ jil pii a tẽe wʋ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />A Nãaŋmɩn kʋn a Isɩral nɩbɛ kpɛ̃ɔ ka ba jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a Lachisɩ deme a jɛɛr ber ayi daar. Nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a Libina, baa bar nɩrɛ jaa ɛ, ba kʋn ba jaa a tẽe pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />A Horam na ɩ Gɛsɛ nãa 'yir wa pʋↄ na sʋ̃ʋ a Lachisɩ deme, tɩchɛ a Josʋwa jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a 'lↄ nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ na wʋ kʋ ba jaa, ka a ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba chɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ pãa yin be a Lachisɩ chen a Ɛgilↄn na ba tɩ jil pii a tẽe wʋ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Ba tʋ̃ɔn a tẽe, kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa a daar 'lↄnↄ nɩtãa a lɛ ban dɔ̃ɔ kʋ a Lachisɩ deme.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />A anyã puor, Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ yin be a Ɛgilↄn do be a Hɛbʋrↄn, na ba tɩ pii a tẽe, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />na ba nyɔɔr a nɩbɛ. Ba kʋn a nãa nɩ nɩrɛ jaa a tẽe pↄ nɩ a tẽn ala na gbʋr a Hɛbʋrↄn. Josʋwa sɔ̃ɔn a tẽe wʋ jaa nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ sɔ̃ɔ a Ɛgilↄn, waa bar nɩrɛ jaa ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Be lɛ ka a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ pãa lɩɛb chen tɩ pii a Dɛbir tẽe. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Wʋ tɩ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a tẽe nɩ a nãa nɩ a tẽn ala na gbʋr a be. Ba kʋn a nɩbɛ ba jaa. Josʋwa maal a Dɛbir tẽdeme nɩ a ba nãa nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ maal a Hɛbʋrↄn nɩ a Libina nãa.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Josʋwa jɛb de a paal wʋ jaa. Wʋ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a nãmine bala na be a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n ju, a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie nɛʋ nɩ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tɔ̃n, nɩ a dãlpʋɔ na be a sa-par gʋba jie. Waa bar nɩrɛ jaa ɛ, wʋ kʋn ba jaa. Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn kpãkpãan. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Josʋwa tʋ̃ɔ ba naa yin be a Kadɛsɩ Baanɩya tɩ tan Gasa, nɩ an yi a Gɔɔsɛn paal wʋ jaa tɩ tan a Gibiɔn. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />A Josʋwa jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a nãmine banyãna ba jaa nɩ a ba paalsɩ a jɛɛr bõ'yen 'lɔnɔ pɔ bojũu, a Isɩral nɩbɛ Ŋmɩn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn lɛ dɔ̃ɔ jɛɛrɛ kʋrↄ a Isɩral.<verse eid="JOS 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />A anyã puor, a Josʋwa nɩ a wʋ jɛjɛɛrbɛ lɩɛb chen be a Gilgal na ɩ a ba jaa-jie.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Josʋwa Na Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ A Jabin Nɩ A Tẽn Ala Na Pʋɔ A Jabin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />A sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a Jabin na ɩ a Hasɔr nãa na wa wõ a Isɩral jɛb tʋ̃ɔfʋ, wʋ tʋ̃n 'yɛr kʋ Jobab na ɩ a Madↄn nãa nɩ a Sɩmɩrↄn nɩ a Akɩsafʋ nãmine <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />nɩ a nãmine bala na be a tɔ̃n paalsɩ na be a sa-par dɩr jie, a Jɔɔdan baa pↄ a sa-par gʋba jie na be a Galilee man par, a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n sɩɛ pɔ, nɩ a tẽn ala na be a Dↄr man lõboor. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Wʋ mɩ lɛ tʋ̃n 'yɛr kʋ a Keena nɩbɛ na be a Jɔɔdan lõbobo ayi nɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Heeti nɩbɛ nɩ a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ na be be a tɔ̃n paalsɩ pɔ, nɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ na be a Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ɔ sɩɛ par be a Misipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Ba waan naa a ba jɛjɛɛrbɛ ba jaa ka ba waa nɩtãa man bire. Ba mɩ lɛ tara naa wiir nɩ a ba torokosɩ. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />A nãmine banyãna ba jaa lɔ̃ɔn taa a ba jɛjɛɛrbɛ wa tuor be Mɛrum kʋ̃ɔ par na wa jɛb a Isɩral nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ta vɛ̃ ka dãbɩ̃ɛ kʋrɔ fʋ a ba 'yɔ̃ɔ ɛ, bio a nɩtɔ̃nɔ sɔ̃ɔ, N na kʋn ba jaa kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ. Yɩ kar a ba wiir gbɛɛ tɩ chʋm a ba torokosɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Be lɛ a Josʋwa tɩ dũu pii ba be a Mɛrum kʋ̃ɔ par. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃ ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ ba, a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb dii ba tɩ tan be a Mɩsɩrɛfↄfʋ Mayɩm sa-par dɩr jie nɩ a Sidon, tɩ tan a Misipa na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. Ba jɛb a jɛɛr tɩ tan sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ ban wa kʋ a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ba jaa. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Ka a Josʋwa maal ba nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr, wʋ kar a ba wiir gbɛɛ tɩ chʋm a ba torokosɩ.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa lɩɛb chen tɩ pii a Hasɔr tẽe, na ba jɛb tʋ̃ɔ ba tɩ kʋ a ba nãa. (A sɔ̃ɔ 'lↄ, a Hasɔr mɩ lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a nãalʋ̃ʋ na bɛrma a paal 'lɔ wʋ jaa pɔ.) <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Ba nʋʋn a nɩbɛ ba jaa, nɩrɛ jaa ba chɛ ɩ vʋr ɛ, tɩ pãa chʋm a tẽe bar.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />A Josʋwa tʋ̃ɔn a tẽn anyãna a jaa nɩ a ba nãmine, kʋn a nɩbɛ ba jaa nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Tɩchɛ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba chʋm a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n jur ɛ, a Hasɔr tẽe tɛɛ lɛ a Josʋwa chʋm. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ wob a ba bʋ̃tarsɩ a jaa nɩ a dʋn yin a tẽn anyãna pↄ, ka a lɩɛb a ba bʋ̃tarsɩ. Tɩchɛ ba kʋn a nɩbɛ ba jaa, baa bar nɩrɛ jaa kʋ ɩ vʋr ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr kʋ a wʋ tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ, ka a Mosesɩ mɩ 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ka wʋ mɩ tu a lɛ a Mosesɩ na 'yɛr. Wʋ tʋ̃ naa a lɛ jaa a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />A Josʋwa jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a paal wʋ jaa, a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n jur nɩ a tɔ̃n sɩɩr pɔ, a sa-par gʋba nɩ a sa-par dɩr jie, a Gɔɔsɛn paal wʋ jaa nɩ a paal 'lɔ a wʋ sa-par gʋba jie nɩ a Jɔɔdan baa pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17-18" />A paal 'lↄ yin a Halakɩ tɔ̃ↄ ju na be a sa-par gʋba na gbʋr a Ɛdↄn tɩ tan be a Baalgadɩ na be a sa-par dɩr jie, nɩ a Lɛbanↄn baa pↄ be a Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ↄ sa-par gʋba jie. Josʋwa jɛb naa a paalsɩ anyãna kor, tɩchɛ wʋ tʋ̃ɔ nyɔɔr ba na wʋ kʋ ba jaa. <verse eid="JOS 11:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />A paal 'lɔ tɛɛ na wa maal a Isɩral nɩbɛ nɛbõ'yen lɛ Gibiɔn, be lɛ a Hivi nɩbɛ bamine kpɩɛrɛ. Ba jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a paalsɩ ala a jaa na chɛ. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />A Nãaŋmɩn mɩ̃ɛ lɛ vɛ̃ ka ba bɔ a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛɛr, a lɛ na vɛ̃ ka ba kʋ ba jaa na baa lɛ kaa a ba nɩbaal ɛ. Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />A sɔ̃ɔ nyãna lɛ a Josʋwa chen tɩ kʋ a nɩbɛ bala na ta tɩ bɛrɛ̃sɩ, ban bʋɔlɔ a Anakɩm, na kpɩɛrɛ a tẽn anyãna na be a tɔ̃n ju, Hɛbʋrↄn nɩ a Dɛbir nɩ a Anabi nɩ a tɔ̃n paalsɩ ala a jaa na be a Juda nɩ a Isɩral. Josʋwa kʋn ba jaa tɩ sɔ̃ɔ a ba tẽn bar. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Anakɩm nɩrɛ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba lɛ chɛ a Isɩral paal pↄ ɛ, tɩchɛ a ba bɩlãa lɛ chɛ a Gasa nɩ a Gaafʋ nɩ Asɩdↄdɩ.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Josʋwa jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a paal wʋ jaa nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ. Josʋwa de wʋn kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ, na wʋ ŋma gbulsɩ põ a Isɩral bʋrsɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Ka a jɛɛr baar ka a nɩbɛ pɛ̃n.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">A Nãmine Bala A Mosesɩ Na Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ dɔ̃ɔn jɛb tʋ̃ɔ de a paal kpɩɛrɛ be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, yi a Arnↄn baa pↄ tɩ tan be a Jɔɔdan baa pↄ, tɩ tan be a Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ↄ sa-par dɩr jie. Ba jɛb tʋ̃ɔ nãmine ayi.<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />A ba ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ a Sihↄn na ɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãa na kaara a Hɛsɩbↄn. A Giliyadɩ lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ pʋɔ naa a wʋ nãalʋ̃ʋ pɔ, an yi a Aroya (a Arnↄn baa kõkoor) nɩ a tẽe 'lↄ na be a baa sãlsↄↄ tɩ tan be a Jabɔkɩ man pↄ, a be na ɩ a Amↄn tↄraa, <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />tɩ pʋↄn a Jɔɔdan baa, yin be a Galalii põn na be a sa-par gʋba jie tɩ tan be Bɛfʋ Jɛsɩmɔfʋ (mandal kũu mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie) nɩ a Pɩsɩga tɔ̃ↄ sɩɛ par.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Ba mɩ lɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ Ɔgi na ɩ a Basan nãa, 'lↄ lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a Wurɛfayim nã-baaraa, na dɔ̃ɔ kaara a Asiterɔfʋ nɩ a Edɩryɛl. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />A wʋ nãalʋ̃ʋ den a Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ɔ ju Salɩka nɩ a Basan wʋ jaa tɩ tan a Gɛsʋr nɩ a Maaka tↄraa, tɩ pʋↄn a Giliyadɩ lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ tɩ tan a nãa Sihↄn na be a Hɛsɩbↄn wɛr pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />A nãmine ayi banyã lɛ a Mosesɩ nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ lɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ. Mosesɩ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ den a paalsɩ kʋ Wuruben nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrↄ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrↄ ŋmãa ka wʋ na ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Nãmine Bala A Josʋwa Na Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ a nãmine ba jaa a wɛr 'lↄ pↄ, a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, yi a Baalgadɩ na be a Lɛbanↄn baa pↄ tɩ tan a Halakɩ tɔ̃ɔ ju na be a sa-par gʋba jie na gbʋr a Ɛdↄm. A Josʋwa põn a wɛr nyã kʋ a bʋrsɩ ka a na ɩ a ba sofʋ jaa kpo kpo. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />A jiir ala lɛ a anyãna, a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n ju, a tɔ̃bil na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, a Jɔɔdan baa pɔ nɩ a wʋ tɔ̃bil, a jiir ala na ɩ nɛʋ a be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie nɩ a wɛr kõo 'lɔ na be a sa-par gʋba jie. A wɛr nyã pↄ lɛ a Heeti nɩbɛ nɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Keena nɩbɛ nɩ a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ nɩ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ kpɩɛrɛ. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛb tʋ̃ↄ a tẽn anyãna nãmine, Jɛrɩko nɩ a Ayi ('lɔ na gbʋr a Bɛtɩl.) <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Jɛrusalɛm nɩ a Hɛbʋrↄn nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />Jarmʋfʋ nɩ a Lachisɩ nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Ɛgilↄn nɩ a Gɛsɛ nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />Dɛbir nɩ a Jɛda nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Hↄrma nɩ a Aradɩ nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />Libina nɩ a Adʋlam nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />Makɩda nɩ a Bɛtɩl nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Tapʋya nɩ a Hɛfa nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />Afɛkɩ nɩ a Lasarↄn nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />Madↄn nɩ a Hasɔr nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Sɩmɩrↄn Mɛrↄn nɩ a Akɩsafʋ nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />Tanakɩ nɩ a Mɛgɩdo nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Kɛdɛsɩ nɩ a Jokɩnɩyam (Be a Kamɛl), <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />Dↄr (Be na gbʋr a man nɛɛ) nɩ a Goyɩm (Na be a Galalii) <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />nɩ a Tɩrsa, ba jaa 'lɔ̃ɔn taa ɩ nãmine lɩjɛr nɩ pie nɩ bõ'yen.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">A Wɛɛ Ala Ban Chɛnɛ Sɛɛ Ɩka Ba De</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />A Josʋwa pãa kor nyɔ̃ↄ. A Nãaŋmɩn 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Fʋ kor nyɔ̃ↄ, tɩchɛ wɛɛ amine chɛnɛ na be be na sɛɛ defʋ, <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />a wɛr 'lɔ na chɛ na sɛɛ a defʋ lɛ anyã, a Filisiti nɩbɛ nɩ a Gɛsʋr nɩbɛ wɛr wʋ jaa, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />an yi Sihɔn man na be a Ijipitɩ mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ ta a Ɛkʋrↄn wɛr sa-par dɩr jie, wʋ jaa ɩ naa a Keena nɩbɛ wɛr, (a Filisiti nɩbɛ nãmine anũu wɛɛ ala ban kaara lɛ anyãna, Gasa nɩ a Asɩdↄdɩ nɩ a Asɩkɩlↄn nɩ a Gafʋ nɩ a Ɛkʋrↄn nɩ a Avi nɩbɛ.) <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />A Keena nɩbɛ tẽn a jaa mɩ ben be, nɩ a Mɩɩra ('lↄ na ɩ a Sɩdonɩ nɩbɛ sofʋ) tɩ tan be a Afɛkɩ na ɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ tↄr-bɔɔ, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />a Geba nɩbɛ wɛr, a Lɛbanↄn wʋ jaa tɩ tan be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, yi be Baalgadɩ na be Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ↄ sa-par gʋba jie nɩ a Hamafʋ Paasɩ. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />A anyã pʋɔ naa a Sɩdon nɩbɛ wɛɛ pɔ ban kpɩɛrɛ be a tɔ̃ɔ ju na be a Lɛbanↄn tɔ̃n ju nɩ a Mɩsɩrɛfɔfʋ Mayɩm chara pɔ. N na diin a nɩbɛ banyãna ba jaa bar a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na chiini. A sɛɛ naa ɩka fʋ põ a wɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ nɩtãa a lɛ N na kpãkpãan fʋ. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />A lɛ juu, pãa põ a wɛr nyã kʋ a bʋrsɩ pie for bir bala nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ ŋmãa ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Jɔɔdan Mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ Purfʋ Jie Wɛr Põfʋ.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />A Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔ de a wɛr 'lɔ na be a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie kʋ a Wuruben nɩbɛ bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ nɩbɛ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ nɩbɛ bʋrɔ ŋmãa.<verse eid="JOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />A ba wɛr chen tɩ ta a Aroya (be a Arnↄn baa kõkoor) nɩ a tẽe 'lↄ a baa sãlsↄↄ, pʋↄn a wɛr 'lɔ na gã ju na yi be a Mɛdiba tɩ tan be a Dibↄn. <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />Wʋ yin a be chen tɩ ta a Amↄn tↄr-bɔɔ pↄ 'mãtãan a tẽn ala a jaa a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãa Sihↄn na kaara, 'lↄ lɛ dɔ̃ɔ jɛ̃ a Hɛsɩbↄn kaara a paal wʋ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Tɩ pʋↄn Giliyadɩ, a Gɛsʋr nɩ a Maaka paal, a Hɛmↄn tɔ̃ɔ wʋ jaa nɩ a Basan wʋ jaa tɩ tan be a Salɩka. <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />Wʋ tɩ pʋɔn a Ɔgi nãalʋ̃ʋ wʋ jaa, 'lɔ na ɩ a Wurɛfayim nãa na ɩ a nã-baaraa sʋↄ, 'lɔ lɛ dɔ̃ɔ kaara a Asiterↄfʋ nɩ a Edɩryɛl. Mosesɩ jɛb tʋ̃ɔ dii a nɩbɛ banyãna bar. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Tɩchɛ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba dii a Gɛsʋr nɩ a Maaka nɩbɛ bar ɛ, ba chɛnɛ na kpɩɛrɛ a Isɩral.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Mosesɩ ba ŋmaa a wɛr jie jaa kʋ a Lɛvi bʋrɔ ɛ, nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dɔ̃ɔ 'yɛr kʋ a Mosesɩ. Bala lɛ sɛɛ ɩka ba so a kʋfʋ ala ban ma wa chʋm be a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo ju kʋrɔ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ A Mosesɩ Na Kʋ A Wuruben Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Mosesɩ den a wɛr jie ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩbɛ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />A ba wɛr chen tɩ ta be a Aroya (be a Arnↄn baa kõkoor) nɩ a tẽe 'lↄ a baa sãlsↄↄ, pʋↄn a dondol ala na jil a Mɛdiba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Wʋ tɩ pʋↄn a Hɛsɩbↄn nɩ a tẽn ala a jaa a dondol ju, Dibↄn nɩ a Bamↄfʋ Baal nɩ a Bɛfʋ Baalmɩyↄn nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Jahasɩ nɩ a Kɛdɛmↄfʋ nɩ a Mɛfaafʋ nɩ a <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kɩrɩyatayim nɩ a Sɩbɩma nɩ a Sɛrɛfʋ Sahar na be a baa dondol ju, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Bɛfʋpɩyɔ, a Pɩsɩga tɔ̃ↄ nɛʋ pɔ nɩ a Bɛfʋ Jɛsɩmɔfʋ. <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />Wʋ tɩ pʋↄn a tẽn ala a jaa na be a dondol ju, nɩ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãa Sihↄn nãalʋ̃ʋ wʋ jaa, 'lↄ na dɔ̃ɔ jɛ̃ a Hɛsɩbↄn tɩ kaara a paal wʋ jaa. Mosesɩ jɛb tʋ̃ↄ wʋ nɩ a bala na kaara a Mɩdiyen nɩbɛ, a Ɛvi nɩ a Wurakem nɩ a Sur nɩ a Hur nɩ a Wurɛba. A banyãna ba jaa kaan paalsɩ kʋ a nãa Sihↄn. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />A bala a Isɩral nɩbɛ na dɔ̃ɔ kʋ, a Bɩyↄ bidaba Balam na ɩ a jɩbʋrɔ mɩ pʋↄ naa. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />A Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie lɛ ɩ a Wuruben bʋrɔ tↄr-bɔɔ. A tẽn anyãna lɛ ba de kʋ a Wuruben bʋrɔ ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A wɛr Lɔ Ban Kʋ A Gaadɩ Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Mosesɩ mɩ den a wɛr jie ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />A ba wɛr tɩ pʋɔn a Jasɩr nɩ a Giliyadɩ tẽbɛrɛ a jaa, 'mãtãan a Amↄn wɛr jie ɩ̃sʋɔ tɩ tan be a Aroya na be a Wuraba mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />a ba wɛr chen tɩ yi be a Hɛsɩbↄn tɩ tan Wuramↄfʋ Misipa nɩ a Bɛtonim, yi be a Mahanayim tɩ tan be a Lodɩbar tↄr-bɔɔ pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Be a Jɔɔdan baa pↄ, a tẽn anyãna lɛ pʋↄ, Bɛfʋ Haram nɩ a Bɛfʋnɩmɩra nɩ a Sukofʋ nɩ a Safon nɩ a nãa Sihɔn na be a Hɛsɩbↄn nãalʋ̃ʋ ala na chɛ. A Jɔɔdan man na be a ba mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie lɛ ɩ a ba tↄr-bɔɔ chen tɩ tan a Galalii pon sa-par dɩr jie. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />A anyãna lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil ala ban de kʋ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr Lɔ Ban Kʋ A Manaasɩ Bʋrɔ Ŋmãa A Mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ Purfʋ Jie</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔ de a wɛr jie ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ bamine ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />A ba wɛr chen tɩ ta be a Mahanayim, pʋɔn a Basan wʋ jaa, a Ɔgi nãalʋ̃ʋ wʋ jaa, a Basan nãa nɩ a tẽbil lɩjaata ala a jaa na be a Jaar tẽe pɔ a Basan paal pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Wʋ tɩ pʋↄn a Giliyadɩ ŋmãa, 'mãtãan Asiterↄfʋ nɩ Edɩryɛl na ɩ a Ɔgi nãalʋ̃ʋ pↄ tẽbɛrɛ na be a Basan. Ba den a anyãna a jaa kʋ a Makɩr na ɩ a Manaasɩ bidaba yɔnsuulsɩ ŋmãa.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Mosesɩ põ a wɛr 'lɔ be a Jɛrɩko mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie nɩ a Jɔɔdan, a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ wʋn be a Mowab ji-chãa pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Tɩchɛ a Mosesɩ ba de a wɛr lõboor jie jaa kʋ a Lɛvi bʋrɔ ɛ. Wʋ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, a ba difʋ jie lɛ a kʋfʋsɩ ala ban ma waan wa kʋ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">A Jɔɔdan Mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ Mʋrfʋ Jie Wɛr Põfʋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Nɩtɔ̃nɔ lɛ ba põ a Keena wɛr 'lↄ na be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ. Eliasa na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrloro nɩ a Nun bidaba Josʋwa nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ bʋrsɩ yie nidierbe põn kʋ a nɩbɛ. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ, a bʋrsɩ pie for bir nɩ a ŋmãa bala na be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie ŋmen gbam na ba põn a wɛr. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3-4" />Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔn de nie de a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie wɛr kʋ a bʋrɔ ayi nɩ a ŋmãa bala. (A Josefʋ yↄn par ŋman bʋrsɩ ayi, a Manaasɩ nɩ a Ɛfɩrem.) Tɩchɛ a Mosesɩ ba kʋ a Lɛvi nɩbɛ wɛr jie jaa ɛ. Tɩchɛ ba nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ nɩ wɛɛ na ba kpɩɛrɛ tɩ kaara a ba dʋn. <verse eid="JOS 14:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ põn a wɛr nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Hɛbʋrↄn Ban De Kʋ A Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Daar kɔ̃ɔ lɛ a nɩbɛ bamine yi a Juda bʋrɔ pɔ wa a Josʋwa sɛ̃ be a Gilgal. A ba ɩ̃sʋɔ yuor na di Kaleb na ɩ a Jɛfʋnɛ bidaba na ɩ a Kenɩsɩ nɩrɛ wa 'yɛr kʋ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Fʋ bɔ̃ɔn a bon 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr a be a Kadɛsɩ Barnɩya, yin a fʋ̃ʋ nɩ a maa pↄ kʋ a Mosesɩ na ɩ a Ŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Yuomo lɩjaayi lɛ n nyɛ̃ a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na tʋ̃ ma yin be a Kadɛsɩ Barnɩya ɩka n wa jʋʋr a tẽe nyãna kaa. N lɩɛb wa man wʋ a lɛ jaa n na tɩ nyɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />A dↄↄr bala na lɔ̃ↄ chiin ma, maal ka dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ a sɩ nɩbɛ. Tɩchɛ maa 'lɔ tun a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a n Ŋmɩn nɛɛ sɩrɛ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />A lɛ jũu, Mosesɩ pol kʋ ma ɩka, &lt;Maa nɩ a n bibiir na kpɛn a wɛr 'lɔ pɔ a n gbɛr na nɛb ka wʋ ɩ a sɩ sofʋ.&gt; <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Tɩchɛ pʋ̃pãanyã kaa, a tan yuomo lɩjaayi nɩ anũu a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr a lɛ kʋ a Mosesɩ. A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ lɛ a Isɩral nɩbɛ be a dãlpʋɔ ju chiini, nɩtãa a lɛ Nãaŋmɩn na pol kʋ ma, na wʋ chɛnɛ kʋ ma nyɛvʋr wa tan a dɩna. Kaa ma, n ben nyɛ̃ yuomo lɩjaa naar nɩ anũu! <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />tɩ chɛnɛ kpɛ̃mɛ a dɩna nɩtãa a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Mosesɩ na tʋ̃ ma. N chɛnɛ na kpɛ̃mɛ na tʋ̃ↄ jɛb jɛɛr, bɩɩ na n tʋ̃ↄ maal bon jaa. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Pʋ̃pãanyã, kʋ ma a tɔ̃n paal 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na pol kʋ ma a bibir 'lↄ a maa nɩ a n nɩbɛ na wa man fʋ. Sɩ 'yɛr kʋ fʋ ɩka, a kpɩ̃ɛn deme bala ban bʋɔlɔ a Anakɩm ben a tẽbɛrɛ ala na mɛ jil pↄ. Amine a Nãaŋmɩn na ben a n sɛ̃, ka n na tʋ̃ↄ dii ba nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr nɛvɩla 'yɔ̃ɔ a Kaleb na ɩ a Jɛfʋnɛ bidaba tɩ kʋ wʋ a Hɛbʋrↄn tẽkpɛ̃ɛ ka wʋ ɩ a wʋ sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />A Hɛbʋrↄn chɛnɛ na ɩ a Kaleb na ɩ a Jɛfʋnɛ bidaba na yi a Kenɩsɩ yↄn sofʋ, bojũu wʋ tu naa a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn nɛɛ sɩrɛ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Sɛrɛ ka a nɩtɔ̃ wa ɩ, ba dɔ̃ɔn bʋɔlɔ a Hɛbʋrↄn Arba tẽe. (Arba lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a Anakɩm gãdakpil.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Be lɛ ka ɩ̃gan 'maar pãa be a tẽe pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ a Juda Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />A Juda bʋrɔ nɩ a ba yie deme nyɛ̃n a wɛr lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ, a lɛ an tu taa. A wɛr yin be a sa-par gʋba jie tɩ ta a Sɩn dãlpʋɔ sãlsↄↄ, tɩ nyↄↄn a Ɛdↄm tↄr-bɔɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />A sa-par gʋba jie tↄr-bɔɔ chen tɩ ta be a man nyaar sa-par gʋba jie lõboor, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />den a sa-par gʋba jie tɩ yin a Akɩrabim Paasɩ tɩ tan be a Sɩn. Wʋ yin be a Kadɛsɩ Banɩyan sa-par gʋba lõboor, tɩ vɩɛ a Hɛsɩrↄn bar tɩ don be Adar, lɩɛb chiini be Karka, <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />lɛ chen tɩ ta Asɩmↄn tɩ tuul a pon na be a Ijipitɩ tↄr-bɔɔ pɔ tɩ tan be a Mɛditɛrɛniya man pↄ, be lɛ ɩ a Juda sa-par gʋba tↄr-bɔɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tↄr-bɔɔ lɛ a man nyaar, yin a be tɩ tan a jie 'lↄ a Jɔɔdan kʋ̃ↄ na joro tɩ kpɩɛrɛ a man nyaar pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />A sa-par dɩr jie tↄr-bɔɔ mɩ piel a be, don tɩ ta be Bɛfʋ Hogɩla lɩɛb chen be na lɩɛb kaara Jɔɔdan baa sa-par dɩr jie. Be lɛ wʋ lɛ yi tɩ do be a Bohan kʋsɩr ju (A Bohan dɔ̃ɔn ɩ Wuruben bidaba) <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />yin be a Dɔɔrfʋ Baa pↄ do tɩ ta a Dɛbir, tɩ pãa lɛ lɩɛb sa-par dɩr jie chiini be a Gilgal, be na tor a Adʋmɩm Paasɩ baa a sa-par gʋba jie. Wʋ pãa yin be a Ɛsɛmɛsɩ bul-yirsɩ tɩ ta be a Ɛnɩrↄgɩ, <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />na wʋ do tɩ yi a Hɩnↄm baa tɔr-bɔɔ na be a sa-par gʋba jie be a tɔ̃ↄ ju, a jie 'lↄ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ tẽe na dɔ̃ɔ be a Jɛrusalɛm paal pↄ. A tↄr-bɔɔ lɛ yin be tɩ do a tɔ̃ↄ ju na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie na ɩ a Hɩnↄm baa lõboor mɩ na ɩ a wurɛfayim baa tɛɛfʋ jie a sa-par dɩr jie. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Wʋ lɛ yin a be na wʋ chen be a Nɛfɩtoya bul-yirsɩ pↄ pãa tɩ ta a tẽbɛrɛ ala na gbʋr a Ɛfʋrↄn tɔ̃ↄ. Wʋ pãa lɛ lɩɛb tor a Baala tẽe ('lↄ ban bʋɔlɔ Kɩrɩyafʋ Jɩrɩm), <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />be lɛ wʋ lɩɛb gʋↄr a Baala tẽe a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, tɩ pãa lɩɛb tor a tẽe 'lↄ a tɔ̃ↄ ju na be a Ɛdↄn, tɩ lɛ lɩɛb chen a Jɩrɩm tɔ̃ↄ sa-par dɩr jie lõboor ('lↄ ban bʋɔlɔ Chɛlsalↄn) pãa suu tɩ ta Bɛfʋ Sɛmɛsɩ tɩ chen tɩ vɩɛ a Tɩmɩna bar. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />A tↄr-bɔɔ yin a be tɩ ta a Ɛkʋrↄn tɔ̃ↄ sa-par dɩr jie lõboor, tɩ lɩɛb tor a Sɛkʋrↄn, wʋ lɛ tɩ vɩɛn a Baala tɔ̃ↄ bar tɩ ta Jamɩnɩya. A Mɛditɛrɛniya man lɛ ɩ a ba tↄr-bɔɔ, <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />na ɩ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tↄr-bɔɔ. A tɔr-bɔɔr anyã pɔ lɛ a Juda yie deme kpɩɛrɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleb Jɛb Tʋ̃ɔ A Hɛbʋrↄn Nɩ A Dɛbir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Josʋwa, ba den a Juda wɛr lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a Kaleb na ɩ a Jɛfʋnɛ bidaba na yi a Juda bʋrɔ pↄ. Wʋ de naa a Hɛbʋrↄn tẽe na ɩ a Anakɩ sãa Arba sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kaleb diin a Anakɩ par ka ba yi a tẽkpɛ̃ɛ pↄ, nɩ a Sesaɩ nɩ a Ahɩmanɩ nɩ a Talmayi dɔ̃dɔɩ. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Wʋ yin a be chen tɩ jɛb a nɩbɛ bala na kpɩɛrɛ be a Dɛbir (a tẽkpɛ̃ɛ nyã lɛ ba dɔ̃ɔ bʋɔlɔ Kɩrɩyafʋ Sɛfa.) <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Ka a Kaleb 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;N na den a n bipↄↄ Akɩsa kʋ a daba 'lↄ jaa na wa tʋ̃ↄ jɛb tʋ̃ↄ Kɩrɩyafʋ Sɛfa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Ofʋnɩɛl, 'lↄ na ɩ a Kaleb yɛbɛ bidaba jɛb tʋ̃ↄ a tẽe, ka a lɛ vɛ̃ ka a Kaleb de a wʋ bipↄↄ Akɩsa kʋ wʋ ka wʋ ɩ a wʋ pↄↄ.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />A kultaa bibir lɛ a Ofʋnɩɛl 'yɛr kʋ a wʋ pɔɔ Akɩsa ɩka, a wʋ sʋↄr wɛr yin a wʋ sãa sɛ̃, wʋn wa suu a bʋ̃ɔ ju ka a Kaleb sʋʋr wʋ a bon 'lɔ wʋn bʋɔrɔ.<verse eid="JOS 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Ka wʋ 'yɛr sɔɔ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;N bʋↄrↄ naa jie 'lɔ kʋ̃ↄ na be. A jie 'lↄ fʋn kʋ ma ɩ naa jikõo.&gt;&gt; Ka a Kaleb de a lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ na tara bul-yirsɩ ala kʋ wʋ.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Juda Tẽbɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />A wɛr nyã lɛ a Juda bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme nyɛ̃ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />A tẽbɛrɛ ala na gã chen a be a ba Sa-par gʋba jie lɛ ɩ a ba sofʋ, tɩchɛ ka a ala mɩ na gbʋr a Ɛdↄm tↄr-bɔɔ mɩ ɩ Kabɩsɛɛl nɩ Ɛda nɩ Jagʋr nɩ<verse eid="JOS 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kɩna nɩ Dimora nɩ Adada nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kɛdɛsɩ nɩ Hasɔr nɩ Ɛtɩnan nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Sɩfʋ nɩ Tɛlɛm nɩ Bɛlↄfʋ, nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hasɔr Hadata nɩ Kɛrↄfʋ Hɛsɩrↄn (bɩɩ Hasɔr) nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam nɩ Sɛma nɩ Molada nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hasa Gada nɩ Hɛsɩmↄn nɩ Bɛfʋpɛlɛfʋ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hasa Sʋwal nɩ Bɛsɩba nɩ Bɩsɩyotɩya nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala nɩ Iim nɩ Ɛsɛm nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Ɛltoladɩ nɩ Chɛlsɩl nɩ Hɔrma nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Sɩkɩlagɩ nɩ Madɩmana nɩ Sansana nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lɛbafʋ nɩ Sɩlɩm nɩ Ayin nɩ Wurimↄn. A tẽbɛrɛ a jaa na 'mãtaa ɩ naa lɩjɛr nɩ pie for bir nɩ a tẽbil ala a jaa na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />A tẽbɛrɛ ala na be a tɔ̃n sɩɛ par lɛ a anyãna. Ɛsɩtayↄl nɩ Sora nɩ Asɩna nɩ<verse eid="JOS 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Sanowa nɩ Ɛnganɩm nɩ Tapʋya nɩ Ɛnam nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Jarmʋfʋ nɩ Adʋlam nɩ Soko nɩ Asɩka nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Saarayim nɩ Aditayim nɩ Gɛdɩra nɩ Gɛdɩrotayim, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ anaar nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Tẽn anyã mɩ pʋɔ naa, Sɛnan nɩ Hadasa nɩ Mɩldalgadɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dɩlɩyan nɩ Mɩsɩpa nɩ Jokɩtɛɛl nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lachisɩ nɩ Bosɩkatɩ nɩ Ɛgilↄn nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabↄn nɩ Lamam nɩ Chɩtɩlɩsɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gɛdɩrↄfʋ nɩ Bɛtɩdagↄn nɩ Naama nɩ Makɛda, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayʋↄb nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />A tẽn anyã mɩ pʋɔ naa, Libina nɩ Ɛta nɩ Asan nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ɩfɩta nɩ Asɩna nɩ Nɛsɩb nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keela nɩ Akɩsɩb nɩ Marɩsa, tẽbɛrɛ pie for bir nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ɛkʋrↄn tẽe mɩ ben be tara a tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />nɩ a tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil ala na gbʋr a Asɩdↄdɩ, yi be a Ɛkʋrↄn tɩ tan be a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Asɩdↄdɩ nɩ Gasa tẽe nɩ a ba tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil dɔ̃ɔ be be tɩ ta a pon na be a Ijipitɩ tↄr-bɔɔ pɔ na gbʋr a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal nɛɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />A tẽn ala a tɔ̃n ju lɛ a anyãna, Samir nɩ Jatɩr nɩ Soko nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Dana nɩ Kɩrɩyafʋ Sɛfa (bɩɩ Dɛbir) nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anabi nɩ Ɛsɩtɛmo nɩ Anim nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Gɔɔsɛn nɩ Holon nɩ Gilo, a tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ bõ'yen nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />A tẽn anyãna mɩ dɔ̃ɔn be be, Arabi nɩ Duma nɩ Ɛsan nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Janim nɩ Bɛfʋ Tapʋya nɩ Afɛkɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humta nɩ Hɛbʋrↄn nɩ Sɩyↄ, tẽbɛrɛ pie for bir nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />A tẽn anyã mɩ pʋɔ naa, Mayↄn nɩ Kamɛl nɩ Sɩfʋ nɩ Juta nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Jɛsɩrɛɛl nɩ Jokɩdim nɩ Sanowa nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Keen nɩ Gibɩya nɩ Tɩmɩna, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />A tẽbɛrɛ anyã mɩ pʋɔ naa, Halhuul nɩ Bɛtɩsↄ nɩ Gɛdↄr nɩ <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarafʋ nɩ Bɛfʋ-Anↄfʋ nɩ Ɛltɛkↄn, tẽbɛrɛ ayʋↄb nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />A tẽn anyã mɩ pʋɔ naa, Kɩrɩyafʋ Baal (Ban bʋɔlɔ Kɩrɩyafʋ Jirim) nɩ Wuraba, tẽbɛrɛ ayi nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />A tẽn ala a dãlpʋɔ ju lɛ a anyãna, Bɛfʋ Araba nɩ Midin nɩ Sɛkaka nɩ<verse eid="JOS 15:61" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nɩbɩsan, a Nyaar tẽe nɩ Ɛnjidi, a tẽbɛrɛ ayʋↄb nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Tɩchɛ a Juda nɩbɛ ba tʋ̃ɔ dii a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ bala na be a Jɛrusalɛm bar ɛ. Ka a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ lɔ̃ↄ kpɩɛrɛ nɩ a Juda nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Ɛfɩrem Nɩ A Manaasɩ Nɩbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />A Josefʋ yɔnsuulsɩ wɛr ban kʋ ba tɔraa na be a sa-par gʋba jie pielaa a Jɔɔdan man na gbʋr a Jɛrɩko, be a jɛrɩko bul-yirsɩ na be a Jɛrɩko mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ ta be a dãlpʋɔ ju. Wʋ yin be a Jɛrɩko tɩ ta be a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃ɔ ju tɩ tan be a Bɛtɩl. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Mɩ lɛ yi be a Bɛtɩl tɩ tan be a Luusɩ, tɩ kpɛ be Atarↄfʋ Ada, be a Akayɩtɩ nɩbɛ na kpɩɛrɛ. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Wʋ pãa lɛ yin be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tɩ ta be a Jafɩlatɩ nɩbɛ na kpɩɛrɛ tɩ tan be Bɛfʋ Hↄrↄn nɛʋ pɔ. Wʋ lɛ yin a be tɩ ta Gɛsɛ tɩ pãa tɩ tɛɛ be a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />A Josefʋ yɔnsuulsɩ, a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie nyɛ̃n a wɛr nyã ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />A Ɛfɩrem nɩbɛ wɛr bↄↄ mɩ lɛ a nyã, a ba tↄr-bɔɔ yin be a Atarↄfʋ Ada a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ tan be a Bɛfʋ Hↄrↄn jusɔɔ, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />mɩ lɛ yi a be tɩ ta a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pↄ. Tɩchɛ ka a Mɩkɩmɛtafʋ mɩ be a ba sa-par dɩr jie. A ba tↄraa yin be Tanafʋ Sɩlↄn na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ tan be Janʋwa a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Tɩ mɩ lɛ yi be a tɩ suu Janʋwa tɩ ta be Atarↄfʋ nɩ Naara, tɩ ta be a Jɛrɩko tɩ na wʋ tɩ tɛɛ a Jɔɔdan man pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />A ba tↄraa yin be a Tapʋya na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tɩ tan be a Kana kʋl bile pↄ tɩ tɛɛ a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pↄ. A wɛr anyã lɛ ba kʋ a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ yie deme ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />nɩ a tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil amine na be a Manaasɩ wɛr pɔ, a jaa ɩ naa a Ɛfɩrem nɩbɛ sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Tɩchɛ baa dii a Keena nɩbɛ bala na kpɩɛrɛ a Gɛsɛ ɛ, a lɛ jũu ka a Keena nɩbɛ lɔ̃ɔ kpɩɛrɛ nɩ a Ɛfɩrem nɩbɛ wa tan a dɩna, tɩchɛ ka ba ma fɩr ba ka ba tʋ̃nɔ gbãgba-tʋ̃mɔ̃.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />A wɛr lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ na be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie lɛ ba de kʋ a Josefʋ bida-kpɛ̃ɛ Manaasɩ yɔnsuulsɩ sofʋ. Makɩr na ɩ a Giliyadɩ sãa ɩ naa a Manaasɩ bida-kpɛ̃ɛ na ɩ a jɛjɛ-kpɩl, lɛ mɩ lɛ a Giliyadɩ nɩ a Basan na be a Jɔɔdan wɛr mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie mɩ ɩ a wʋ sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />A Jɔɔdan wɛr mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie mɩ lɛ ba de kʋ a Manaasɩ yie deme banyãna na chɛ, Abiesa nɩ Hɛlɛkɩ nɩ Asɩrɛl nɩ Sɛchɛm nɩ Hɛfa nɩ Sɛmɩda. A Manaasɩ na ɩ a Josefʋ bidaba yɔnsuulsɩ lɛ a banyãna na ɩ a dɔɔr na ɩ a yie nɩbɛrɛ.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Manaasɩ bidaba lɛ a Makɩr ka a Makɩr mɩ ɩ Giliyadɩ bidaba ka Giliyadɩ bidaba mɩ ɩ Hɛfa ka a Hɛfa mɩ dɔɔ Sɛlofɛhadɩ. Tɩchɛ Sɛlofɛhadɩ ba tara dabil ɛ, pↄↄbil tɛɛ lɛ wʋ tara. A ba yoe lɛ a anyãna, Maala nɩ Nowa nɩ Hogɩla nɩ Mɩlka nɩ Tɩrsa. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Be lɛ ba chen a Eliasa na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro nɩ a Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba nɩ a nidierbe sɛ̃ tɩ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;A Nãaŋmɩn kpãkpãan a Mosesɩ ɩka wʋ kʋ sɩn nɩ a sɩ yɛɛr bala na ɩ a dɔɔr a wɛr jie ɩ̃sʋɔ ka wʋ ɩ a sɩ sofʋ.&gt;&gt; Nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan, ba den a wɛr lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a bala nɩ a ba yɛɛr bala na ɩ a dɔɔr ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Ala lɛ so ka a Manaasɩ nyɛ̃ a wɛr ban põ jiir pie lɛ pʋↄn a Giliyadɩ nɩ a Basan be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />bojũu, a wʋ yɔnsuulsɩ na ɩ a pↄↄbil nɩ a ba yɛɛr bala na ɩ a dɔɔr nyɛ̃n a wɛr ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ. Ba den a Giliyadɩ wɛr kʋ a Manaasɩ yɔnsuulsɩ bala na chɛ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />A Manaasɩ paal yin be a Asa tɩ tan be a Mɩkɩmɛtafʋ na be a Sɛkɛm mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. A tↄr-bɔɔ chen a sa-par gʋba jie lõboor tɩ den a be a Ɛntapʋya nɩbɛ na be. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />A wɛr 'lↄ na jil a Tapʋya ɩ naa a Manaasɩ sofʋ, tɩchɛ a Tapʋya tẽe 'lↄ na be a tↄraa pↄ mɩ ɩ a Ɛfɩrem yɔnsuulsɩ sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />A tↄraa pãa yin a be tɩ suu a Kana kʋl-bile pↄ. A tẽbɛrɛ ala na be a kʋl-bile sa-par gʋba jie ɩ naa a Ɛfɩrem sofʋ, an sↄↄ be a Manaasɩ wɛr pↄ. A Manaasɩ wɛr tↄraa lɛ yin be a kʋl-bile sa-par dɩr jie tɩ tan be Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Ɛfɩrem ben a sa-par gʋba jie, tɩchɛ ka a Manaasɩ be a sa-par dɩr jie tɩ ka a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal ɩ a ba mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tɔraa.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Isaka nɩ a Asa wɛr pↄ, Bɛfʋ San nɩ Ibɩliyɛm nɩ a tẽbil ala a jaa a ba lõbobo pɔ ɩ naa a Manaasɩ sofʋ, tɩ den a Dↄr (a 'lɔ na be a man nɛɛ), Ɛndↄr nɩ Tanakɩ nɩ Mɛgɩdo nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />A Manaasɩ nɩbɛ ba tʋ̃ↄ dii a nɩbɛ bala na kpɩɛrɛ a tẽbɛrɛ ala pↄ ɛ, a lɛ jũu, ka a Keena nɩbɛ pãa chɛnɛ kpɩɛrɛ a be. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ gba a Isɩral na wa kpɛ̃mɛ, tɩchɛ baa dii a Keena nɩbɛ ba jaa bar ɛ, tɩchɛ bama fɩrɛ ban ka ba tʋ̃nɔ kʋrↄ ba.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Ka a Josefʋ yɔnsuulsɩ pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Bo lɛ so ka fʋ kʋ sɩ a wɛr lõboor bõ'yen tɛɛ ka wʋ ɩ a sɩ sofʋ?&gt;&gt; Sɩ waan yↄↄ jaa bojũu a Nãaŋmɩn bɩɛl sɩ naa.<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr sɔɔ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Ala ɩ yɩ ɩn yↄↄ jaa, ka a Ɛfɩrem paalsɩ ala na be a tɔ̃n ju ɩ pʋʋr kʋ yɩ, yɩ kpɛ a mɔ̃gɔ̃ɔ be a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Wurɛfayim wɛr pɔ tɩ chɔɔr jie kʋ a yɩ mɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Ka ba 'yɛr sɔɔ wʋ ɩka, &lt;&lt;A tɔ̃ɔ ju paal nyã ɩ naa pʋʋr kʋ sɩ, tɩchɛ a Keena nɩbɛ na be a ji-chãa pↄ tara naa wiir kur torokosɩ, a bala na be a Bɛfʋ San nɩ a tẽn ala a wʋ lõboor nɩ a bala na be a Jɛsɩrɛɛl baa pↄ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a Ɛfɩrem nɩ a Manaasɩ par nɩbɛ bala na kpɩɛrɛ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, &lt;&lt;Sɩrɛ jaa yɩ waa naa, na yɩ mɩ kpɛ̃mɛ. A sɛɛ naa ɩka yɩ nyɛ̃ a wɛr gar a lɛ. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />A wɛr 'lↄ a tɔ̃ↄ ju na ɩ naa a yɩ sofʋ. Wʋn sↄↄ ɩ a mɔ̃gɔ̃ɔ pↄ, tɩchɛ yɩ chↄↄr wʋ ka wʋ ɩ a yɩ sofʋ yin a lõbobo a jaa. A Keena nɩbɛ 'lↄ, yɩn dii ban bar, ban sↄↄ tara a wiir kur torokosɩ nɩ a nɩkpɩ̃ɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Na Chɛ Ban Põ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa jɛb de a wɛr wa baar, ba jaa lɔ̃ɔ taa be a Silo na ba maal a fɔbaa yir kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />A Isɩral bʋrsɩ ayopõi ben be ban ba kʋ a wɛɛ sɛrɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ, &lt;&lt;Sɔ̃ↄ buor lɛ yɩ bʋↄrↄ ɩka yɩ chɛl tɩ ta, sɛrɛ tɩ pãa tɩ de a wɛr 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn, na ɩ a yɩ sãakpãmine Ŋmɩn na kʋ yɩ? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Yɩ 'yir dↄↄr ata yin bʋrɔ jaa pↄ ka ba wa. N na vɛ̃n ka ba kpɛ a paal pↄ kaa a jiir ala ban na bʋↄrↄ 'yɔ̃ɔ jɩnɛ ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ. Bala wa ɩ a lɛ wa baar, ka ba lɛ lɩɛb wa a n sɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />N na põn a wɛr nyã jiir ayopõi kʋ ba, Juda bʋrɔ na ben a ba wɛr pↄ na be a sa-par gʋba jie, ka a Josefʋ bʋrɔ mɩ be a wʋ wɛr pↄ na ɩ a sa-par dɩr jie. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Yɩ Sɛb a põfʋ jiir ayopõi anyãna wa kʋ ma. Ka n pãa ŋme gbam sʋʋr a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a sɩ Ŋmɩn kaa kʋ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Tɩchɛ a Lɛvi nɩbɛ kʋ nyɛ̃ a wɛɛ anyãna n na põ ɛ, bojũu a ba tʋ̃mɔ̃ lɛ ɩka ba ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlorobo. Tɩchɛ Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrↄ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie dɔ̃ɔn nyɛ̃ a ba wɛɛ a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, be a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na dɔ̃ɔ de kʋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Ka a dↄↄr ata bala a Josefʋ na 'yir yin a bʋrsɩ pↄ pãa kpɛ a wɛr pↄ tɩ 'yir a jiir ala ban bʋↄrↄ 'yɔ̃ɔ jɩnɛ nɩtãa a lɛ a Josʋwa na tɩr a nɛɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ kpɛ a wɛr pↄ tɩ 'yir a jiir ala yɩn bʋↄrↄ 'yɔ̃ɔ jɩnɛ tɩ lɩɛb wa a n sɛ̃, ka n pãa ŋme gbam a ka a Silo sʋʋr a sɩ Nãaŋmɩn kaa kʋ yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Ka a dↄↄr bala kpɛ a wɛr wʋ jaa pãa sɛb wile a lɛ ban põ yaa a tẽn jiir ayopõi. Tɩ na ba lɩɛb wa a Josʋwa sɛ̃ be a Silo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa ŋme a gbam sʋʋr a Nãaŋmɩn kaa kʋ ba, tɩ pãa põ a wɛr 'lↄ na chɛ kʋ a Isɩral bʋrsɩ bala na chɛ.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Bɛnjamɩn Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />A Bɛnjamɩn bʋrɔ yie deme lɛ ɩ a nɩbɛ bala na de nie nyɛ̃ a wɛr ban põ. A ba wɛr gan a Juda bʋrɔ nɩ a Josefʋ bʋrɔ wɛr chara pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />A Jɔɔdan wɛr lɛ ɩ a ba tↄraa a sa-par dɩr jie, na wʋ do tɩ tan be a nɛʋ na be a Jɛrɩko sa-par dɩr jie, ka a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie mɩ yi be a tẽn ala na be a tɔ̃n ju tɩ tan be Bɛtavɛn dãlpʋɔ ju. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />A ba tↄr-bɔɔ pãa yin be a nɛʋ na be a Luusɩ sa-par gʋba jie (ban bʋɔlɔ Bɛtɩl), na wʋ lɛ suu tɩ ta be a Atarↄfʋ Ada be a tɔ̃ↄ ju sa-par gʋba jie, na be a Bɛfʋ Hↄrↄn nɛʋ pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />A ba tↄraa pãa lɛ tɩ tun jie ɩ̃sʋɔ, a sa-par gʋba jie na yi a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie na yi a tɔ̃ↄ ju chiini be a Kɩrɩyafʋ Baal (ban bʋɔlɔ Kɩrɩyafʋ Jɩrɩyam) na ɩ a Juda bʋrɔ sofʋ. Nyã lɛ dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie tɔraa. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />A sa-par gʋba jie tↄr-bɔɔ yin be a Kɩrɩyafʋ Jɩrɩyam kõkoor tɩ tan be Nɛfɩtoya bul-yirsɩ pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Wʋ pãa lɛ suun a tɔ̃ↄ sɩɛ 'lↄ na tor a Hɩnↄm baa, be na ɩ a Wurɛfayim sa-par dɩr jie baa lõboor. Wʋ pãa lɛ chen a Hɩnↄm baa sa-par gʋba jie, a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ gbĩgbĩn sa-par gʋba jie, na tor a Ɛnɩrogɛl. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Wʋ pãa lɛ lɩɛb a sa-par dɩr jie tɩ yi Ɛnsɛmɛsɩ tɩ tan be Gɛlɩlↄfʋ, na tor Adʋmɩm Paasɩ gɔ̃ↄn lɛ a lɛ. A tↄraa lɛ yin a be tɩ suu be a Bohan kʋsɩr par, (A Bohan ɩ naa Wuruben bidaba) <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />na wʋ lɩɛb tɩ yi be a gbĩgbĩn na be a sa-par dɩr jie na tor a Jɔɔdan baa, pãa yi a be tɩ suu a baa pↄ, <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />na wʋ tuul a gbĩgbĩn na be a Bɛfʋ Hogɩla tɩ tɛɛ be a sa-par dɩr jie a be man nyaar pɔ, a jie 'lↄ a Jɔɔdan kʋ̃ↄ na joro tɩ kpɩɛrɛ. A nyã dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a sa-par gʋba jie tↄr-bɔɔ. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />A Jɔɔdan man mɩ lɛ ɩ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tↄraa. A lõbobo anyãna lɛ ɩ a Bɛnjamɩn nɩbɛ bʋrɔ wɛr tɔr-bɔɔ na ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />A tẽbɛrɛ ala na ɩ a Bɛnjamɩn nɩbɛ bʋrɔ yie deme sofʋ lɛ, Jɛrɩko nɩ Bɛfʋ Hogɩla, nɩ Ɛmɛkɩ Kɩsɩsɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bɛfʋ Araba nɩ Sɩmaruyam nɩ Bɛtɩl nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Avim nɩ Para nɩ Ofɩra nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Sɛfaramoni nɩ Ofini nɩ Geba, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayi 'mãtãan a tẽbil ala na jil ba. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />A tẽn anyãna mɩ ben be, Gibiɔn nɩ Wurama nɩ Bɛɛrↄfʋ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mɩsɩpa nɩ Chɛfɩra nɩ Mosa nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Wurakem nɩ Irpiil nɩ Tarala nɩ <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Sɩla nɩ Haelefʋ nɩ Jebusɩ 'lↄ ban bʋɔlɔ Jɛrusalɛm nɩ Gibɩya nɩ Kɩrɩyafʋ Jɩrɩyam, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ anaar, nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba. A wɛr nyã lɛ ɩ a Bɛnjamɩn bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Sɩmɩ̃ɛ Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ ayi sʋↄ lɛ ɩ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ sofʋ. A ba wɛr tɩ kpɛ̃n a Juda bʋrɔ nɩbɛ wɛr pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />A tẽn ala na pʋↄ lɛ a anyã, Bɛsɩba nɩ Sɩba nɩ Molada nɩ<verse eid="JOS 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hasa Sʋwal nɩ Bala nɩ Ɛsɛm nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Ɛltoladɩ nɩ Bɛtʋl nɩ Hↄrma nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Sɩkɩlagɩ nɩ Bɛfʋ Markabↄfʋ nɩ Hasa Susa nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Bɛfʋ Lɛbawʋfʋ nɩ Sɛruhɛn, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ata nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />A tẽn anyãna mɩ ben be, Ayin nɩ Wurimↄn nɩ Ɛta nɩ Asan, tẽbɛrɛ anaar nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil ba. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />A anyãna lɛ pʋↄ a tẽbil ala a jaa na jil a tẽbɛrɛ a jaa tɩ tan Balafʋ Bɛɛr, ban bʋɔlɔ Wurama na be a sa-par gʋba jie. Nyã lɛ ɩ a wɛr 'lↄ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme na nyɛ̃ ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />A Juda bʋrɔ nɩbɛ wɛr na bɛrma gar a lɛ ban bʋɔrɔ jũu, ala lɛ so ka ba ŋmaa a ba wɛr ŋmãa kʋ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Sɛbulun</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ ata sʋↄ lɛ ɩ a Sɛbulun bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ. A ba wɛr 'lↄ ban nyɛ̃ chen jaa tɩ ta be a Sarɩdɩ.<verse eid="JOS 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />An yi a be, a ba tↄr-bɔɔ chen Marɛl na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, be na gbʋr a Dabɛsɛfʋ nɩ a Jokɩnɩyam mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie kʋl-bile pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />A Sarɩdɩ gɔ̃ↄ na ɩ a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie chen tɩ nyↄↄn Chɩsɩlↄfʋ Tabↄr tↄraa, tɩ lɛ tɩ yin be Dabɛrafʋ tɩ don Jafɩya. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Wʋ chɛnɛ na choo yi a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ ta be Gafʋ Hɛfa nɩ Ɛtɩkasɩn, na wʋ lɩɛb tor a Nɩya na be a Wurimↄn sↄr pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />A sa-par dɩr jie, a tↄr-bɔɔ lɩɛb tor a Hanatↄn, tɩ tɛɛ a Ifɩtahɛl baa pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />A tẽn anyãna pʋↄ naa, Katafʋ nɩ Nahalali nɩ Sɩmɩrↄn nɩ Idala nɩ Bɛtɩlɛhɛm, tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayi nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil yaa.<verse eid="JOS 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />A tẽbɛrɛ anyãna nɩ a ba tẽbil a jaa pʋↄ na ɩ a Sɛbulun bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Isaka</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ anaar sʋↄ ɩ naa Isaka bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />A tẽn ala na ɩ a ba sofʋ lɛ a anyã, Jɛsɩrɛɛl nɩ Chɛsulↄfʋ nɩ Sunɛm nɩ<verse eid="JOS 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafarɩyam, nɩ Sɩyↄn nɩ Anaharafʋ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Wurabifʋ nɩ Kɩsɩyↄn nɩ Ɛbɛsɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Wuramↄfʋ nɩ Ɛnganɩm nɩ Ɛnada nɩ Bɛfʋ-pasɩsɩ. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />A ba tↄr-bɔɔ mɩ tɩ nyↄↄn Tabↄr nɩ Sahasuma nɩ Bɛfʋ Sɛmɛsɩ tɩ tɛɛ be a Jɔɔdan man pↄ. A ɩ naa tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayʋↄb nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil yaa.<verse eid="JOS 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />A tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil anyãna a jaa lɛ lɔ̃ↄ taa ɩ a Isaka bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Asa Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ anũu sʋↄ lɛ ba kʋ a Asa bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />A tẽn ala na ɩ a ba sofʋ lɛ a anyã, Hɛlkafʋ nɩ Hali nɩ Bɛtɩn nɩ Akɩsafʋ<verse eid="JOS 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alam Mɛlɛkɩ nɩ Amadɩ nɩ Mɩsal. Kamɛl nɩ Sɩhↄ Libɩnafʋ na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie lɛ tɩ ɩ a ba tↄr-bɔɔ. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie mɩ, a tↄr-bɔɔ tɩ yi naa Bɛtɩdagↄn, tɩ nyↄↄn a Sɛbulun nɩ a Ifɩtahɛl baa sa-par dɩr jie na be a Bɛtɩmɛkɩ nɩ Nɩyɛl sↄr pↄ. A sa-par dɩr jie chen tɩ yi, Kabʋl nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Ɛbʋrↄn nɩ Wurɛhↄbɩ nɩ Hamↄn nɩ Kana tɩ tan be a Sɩdon. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />A ba tↄraa lɩɛb tɩ yi Wurama, na wʋ tɩ ta tẽe 'lↄ na mɛ a dachin jil ban bʋɔlɔ Tayɩ, tɩ lɛ lɩɛb yi Hosa tɩ pãa tɛɛ a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal. A tẽn anyã mɩ pʋↄ naa, Mahalabɩ nɩ Akɩsɩb nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Uma nɩ Afɛkɩ nɩ Wurɛhↄbɩ, a tẽbɛrɛ lɩjɛr nɩ ayi nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil yaa.<verse eid="JOS 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />A tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil anyãna a jaa be naa a wɛr 'lɔ na ɩ a Asa bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Nafɩtalɩ Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ ayʋↄb lɛ ɩ a Nafɩtalɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />A ba tↄr-bɔɔ yin be a Hɛlɛfʋ tɩ tan be a tɩkpɛ̃ɛ 'lↄ na be a Saananim, tɩ lɛ tɩ ta be Adaminɛkɛbi nɩ Jamɩnɩya tɩ tan Lakum tɩ tɛɛ a Jɔɔdan man pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />A be lɛ a tↄr-bɔɔ lɩɛb mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie chen a Asɩɩnↄtɩ Tabↄr, tɩ pãa lɛ ara a be tɩ tan Hukoku, tɩ lan be a Sɛbulun be a sa-par gʋba jie na ɩ a bↄↄ, tɩ ka Asa bʋrɔ wɛr be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, tɩ ka a Jɔɔdan man mɩ be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />A tẽbɛrɛ ala ban mɛ dachine jil lɛ a anyã, Sɩdɩm nɩ Sɛr nɩ Hamafʋ nɩ Wurakafʋ nɩ Chɩnɛrɛfʋ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama nɩ Wurama nɩ Hasɔr nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kɛdɛsɩ nɩ Edɩryɛl nɩ Ɛnasↄ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yɩrↄn nɩ Mɛgɩdalɛl nɩ Horɛm nɩ Bɛfʋanↄfʋ nɩ Bɛfʋ Sɛmɛsɩ, tẽbɛrɛ lɩjɛr for bir nɩ a tẽbil ala na jil yaa.<verse eid="JOS 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />A tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil anyãna lɛ ɩ a Nafɩtalɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr 'Lɔ Ban De Kʋ A Dan Bʋrɔ</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />A põfʋ gbɛɛ ayopõi sʋↄ lɛ ba kʋ a Dan bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />A ba paal tẽn lɛ a anyã, Sora nɩ Ɛsɩtayↄl nɩ Arɩsɩmɛsɩ nɩ<verse eid="JOS 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Saalbim nɩ Ayijalↄn nɩ Ɩtɩla nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Ɛlↄn nɩ Tɩmɩna nɩ Ɛkʋrↄn nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Ɛltɛkɩ nɩ Gibɛtↄn nɩ Balafʋ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Jɛhudɩ nɩ Bɛnɛbɛrakɩ nɩ Gafʋ Wurimↄn nɩ <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Mɛjarkↄn nɩ Wurakↄn nɩ a paalsɩ ala na jil a Jopa.<verse eid="JOS 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ ban wa faa a Dan bʋrɔ nɩbɛ wɛr yin a ba nuur pↄ, ba tɩ jɛb tɩɛ Layɩsɩ tẽe. Na ba kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa tɩ faa a tẽe ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ. Ba lɩɛb a yuor na ɩ a Layɩsɩ 'yɔ̃ɔ Dan na ɩ a ba sãakpã, na ba bʋɔlɔ wʋ a Dan.<verse eid="JOS 19:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />A tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a tẽbil anyãna a jaa lɛ ɩ a Dan bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie deme sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Wɛr Põ Baaraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa põ a wɛɛ anyãna baar, ba den a lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ kʋ a Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba, ka wʋ ɩ a wʋ sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan, ba kʋ wʋn a tẽe 'lↄ jaa wʋn wa kaa 'yir, Tɩmɩnafʋ Sera na be a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ tɔ̃ↄ paal pɔ, ka wʋ lɩɛb mɛ a tẽe na wʋ kpɩɛrɛ a be.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro Eliasa nɩ Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba nɩ a Isɩral bʋrsɩ nidierbe ŋmen gbam sʋʋr a Nãaŋmɩn kaa be a Silo, a be a Nãaŋmɩn fɔbaa lɔ̃ɔfʋ yir niem. A nɩtɔ̃ lɛ ba tu na ba põ a wɛr.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">A Tẽbɛrɛ Ala Na Ɩ Jofaafʋ Jie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Be lɛ ka a Nãaŋmɩn pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />wʋ 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɩ 'yir a tẽbɛrɛ ala nɩ na ɩ jofaafʋ tẽn nɩtãa a lɛ N na dɔ̃ɔ 'yɛr kʋ a Mosesɩ ɩka wʋ 'yɛr kʋ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Ala ɩ a yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ wa faan kʋ nɩrɛ, wʋn tʋ̃ↄn jo tɩ sↄↄl a be ka a nɩrɛ 'lↄ mɩ na bʋↄrↄ wʋ ɩka wʋ kʋ ta nyɛ̃ wʋ ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Wʋn tʋ̃ↄn jo chen a tẽbɛrɛ anyãna ɩ̃sʋɔ pↄ, wʋ chen a 'yɛr tↄↄrfʋ jie a be a tẽe dɔ̃dɔr nɛɛ na wʋ tɩ man a lɛ na ɩ kʋ a nidierbe. Ban pãa bar wʋn ka wʋ kpɛ a tẽe pↄ ka ba kʋ wʋ jie ka wʋ kpɩɛrɛ a be. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Ala ɩ a nɩrɛ 'lɔ na bʋↄrↄ a fʋ kʋfʋ yaa a sãn tu fʋn wa a be, a tẽe nɩbɛ ba taa ɩrɛ wa diere fʋ kʋrɔ wʋ ɛ. A sɛɛ naa ɩka ba gu fʋ bojũu fʋ faan kʋ nɩrɛ, an ba ɩ suur lɛ fʋ kʋn wʋ ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Fʋn kpɩɛrɛ naa a tẽe 'lↄ pↄ tɩ tan a paal nɩbɛ na wa tɔɔr a fʋ 'yɛr chãa pɔ, bɩɩ a paal 'lɔ bɔɔrlo nɩkpɛ̃ɛ na wa kpi. Fʋn pãa tʋ̃ↄn lɩɛb kul a fʋ tẽe 'lɔ pɔ fʋn yi jo wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />A lɛ jũu a be a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, ba 'yir Kɛdɛsɩ na be a Galalii paal pↄ, na be a be a tɔ̃ↄ ju na ɩ a Nafɩtalɩ paal, nɩ Sɛchɛm na be a tɔ̃ↄ ju ɩ a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ paal, nɩ Hɛbʋrↄn na be a tɔ̃ↄ ju be a Juda paal pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />A be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, ba 'yir Bɛsɛ na be a Jɛrɩko dondol na be a dãlpʋɔ na be a Wuruben wɛr pɔ, nɩ Wuramↄfʋ na be Giliyadɩ na ɩ a Gaadɩ wɛr nɩ Golan na be a Basan na ɩ a Manaasɩ wɛr. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />A tẽn anyãna lɛ ba 'yir ka a ɩ a jofaafʋ tẽbɛrɛ kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa, nɩ a sãanba na lɔ̃ↄ kpɩɛrɛ nɩ ba. Ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa na wa faa kʋ nɩrɛ na tʋ̃ↄn nyɛ̃ faafʋ a be yin a nɩrɛ 'lↄ mɩ na bʋↄrↄ ɩka wʋ mɩ kʋ wʋ, ba kʋ tʋ̃ↄ kʋ wʋ ka bala ba wa tɔɔr a wʋ 'yɛr chãa pɔ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">A Lɛvi Bʋrɔ Nɩbɛ Tẽbɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />A Lɛvi bʋrɔ nɩbɛ yie nidierbe chen a Eliasa na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro nɩ a Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba nɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ bʋrɔ yie nɩbɛrɛ sɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />Be a Silo na be a Keena paal pↄ tɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;A Nãaŋmɩn dɔ̃ɔn kpãkpãan tu a Mosesɩ ɩka, wʋ kʋ sɩ tẽn ka sɩ kpɩɛrɛ nɩ a jiir ala mↄɛ na be ka a sɩ dʋn dire.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan a Isɩral nɩbɛ, ba kʋ naa a Lɛvi nɩbɛ a tẽbɛrɛ amine, nɩ a wɛɛ ala na tara mↄɛ kʋ ba, yin a ba mɩ̃ɛ paal pɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />A Kohafʋ bʋrↄ na ɩ a Lɛvi nɩbɛ dɔ̃dɔɩ lɛ de nie nyɛ̃ a tẽbɛrɛ. A yie deme bala na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro Aarɔn yↄn nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ata na be a Juda bʋrɔ nɩ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrɔ nɩ a Bɛnjamɩn bʋrɔ wɛɛ pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />A Kohafʋ dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ bala na chɛ mɩ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ pie yin be a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ nɩ Dan bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie wɛɛ pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />A Gɛsↄn dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ mɩ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ata yin be a Isaka bʋrɔ nɩ Asa bʋrɔ nɩ Nafɩtalɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie wɛɛ pɔ.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Mɛrarɩ dɔ̃dɔr yie deme mɩ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayi yin be a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Sɛbulun bʋrɔ wɛɛ pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />A gbam ŋmefʋ pↄ lɛ a tu ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ põ a tẽbɛrɛ nɩ a wɛɛ ala na tara a mɔɛ kʋ a Lɛvi nɩbɛ nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dɔ̃ɔ kpãkpãan tu a Mosesɩ sɛ̃.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Anyãna lɛ ɩ a tẽbɛrɛ ala yoi na yi a Juda bʋrɔ nɩ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrɔ wɛɛ pↄ, <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />ban de kʋ a Aarɔn yɔnsuulsɩ na ɩ a Kohafʋ dɔ̃dɔɩ nɩbɛ na yi a Lɛvi bʋrɔ pɔ. Bala lɛ ɩ a nɩbɛ na de nie nyɛ̃ a wɛr.<verse eid="JOS 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Ba kʋ naa Aaba tẽe (A Aaba dɔ̃ɔ ɩ a Anakɩ sãa) 'lↄ ban pãa bʋɔlɔ Hɛbʋrↄn na be a tɔ̃ↄ ju na ɩ a Juda paal nɩ a wɛr 'lɔ a mʋɔr na jil wʋ. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Tɩchɛ ba den a tẽe wɛr wʋ jaa nɩ a tẽbɛrɛ ala na jil wʋ kʋ a Kaleb na ɩ a Jɛfʋnɛ bidaba.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />A tẽbɛrɛ anyãna lɛ pʋↄ a Hɛbʋrↄn na ɩ a jofaafʋ tẽe ɩ̃sʋɔ pↄ, ba den a tẽn anyãna kʋ a Aarɔn na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro yɔnsuulsɩ, Libina nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Jatɩr nɩ Ɛsɩtɩmʋya nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holon nɩ Dɛbir nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ayin nɩ Juta nɩ Bɛfʋ Sɛmɛsɩ nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir, tẽbɛrɛ pie for bir yin a Juda nɩ a Sɩmɩ̃ɛ bʋrsɩ wɛɛ pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Ba mɩ lɛ nyɛ̃n a tẽbɛrɛ anaar anyãna yin be a Bɛnjamɩn bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Gibiɔn nɩ Geba nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatↄfʋ nɩ Alɩmↄn nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Ka a jaa pãa 'mãtaa ɩ tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ata nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro Aarɔn yɔnsuulsɩ sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />A Lɛvi dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ bamine na yi a Kohafʋ bʋrɔ pɔ nyɛ̃ naa a tẽn amine na be a Ɛfɩrem bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Ba kʋ ba naa tẽbɛrɛ anaar, Sɛchɛm nɩ a wʋ dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jie na be a Ɛfɩrem tɔ̃n paal pɔ (A jofaafʋ tẽe ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ) Gɛsɛ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibisam nɩ Bɛfʋ Hↄrↄn nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Ba lɛ kʋ ba naa a tẽn anaar anyãna yin be a Dan bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Ɛltɛkɩ nɩ Gibɛtↄn nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Ayijalↄn nɩ Gafʋ Wurimↄn nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />A Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, ba kʋ ban tẽbɛrɛ ayi, Tanachɩ nɩ Gafʋ Wurimↄn nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Ka a jaa pãa 'mãtaa ɩ tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir a Kohafʋ dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ na nyɛ̃ ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />A Lɛvi nɩbɛ bamine na ɩ a Gɛsↄn dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ ayi yin be a Manaasɩ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie wɛr pɔ, Golan na be a Basan (A jofaafʋ tẽe ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ) nɩ Bɛsɩtɛra nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Ba lɛ nyɛ̃ naa tẽbɛrɛ anaar yin be a Isaka bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Kɩsɩyↄn nɩ Dabɛrafʋ nɩ<verse eid="JOS 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Jamfʋ nɩ Ɛnganɩm nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Ba lɛ nyɛ̃ naa a tẽbɛrɛ anaar anyãna yin be a Asa bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Mɩsal nɩ Abɩdↄn nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Hɛlkafʋ nɩ Wurɛhↄbɩ nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Ba mɩ lɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ ata yin be a Nafɩtalɩ bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Kɛdɛsɩ na be a Galalii nɩ a wʋ dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir (A jofaafʋ tẽe ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ) Hamↄfʋ Dↄr nɩ Kartan nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />A Gɛsɔn dɔ̃dɔr yie nɩbɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ata nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir ka a ɩ a ba sofʋ.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />A Lɛvi nɩbɛ bala na chɛ, na ɩ a Mɩrari dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ anaar yin be Sɛbulun wɛr pↄ, Jokɩnɩyam nɩ Kata nɩ<verse eid="JOS 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimɩna nɩ Nahalali nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Ba lɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ anaar yin be a Wuruben bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Bɛsɛ nɩ Jahasɩ nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kɛdɩmↄfʋ nɩ Mɛfaafʋ nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Ba mɩ lɛ nyɛ̃n tẽbɛrɛ anaar yin be a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ wɛr pↄ, Wuramↄfʋ na be a Giliyadɩ nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir (A jofaafʋ tẽe ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ), Mahanayim nɩ <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Hɛsɩbↄn nɩ Jasɛ nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir.<verse eid="JOS 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Ka a jaa 'mãtaa ɩ tẽbɛrɛ pie nɩ ayi ban de kʋ a Mɩrari dɔ̃dɔr nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41-42" />Yi a wɛɛ ala a jaa a Isɩral nɩbɛ na tara, ba den Tẽbɛrɛ lɩjaayi nɩ aniin, nɩ a ba dʋn mʋɔr 'wɔfʋ jiir jil ba kʋ a Lɛvi nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:41-42" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Isɩral Na De A Wɛr Ka Wʋ Ɩ A Ba Sofʋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Be lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn pãa de a wɛr 'lↄ wʋ jaa wʋn pol kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ sãakpãmine kʋ ba, ka ba pãa kpɩɛrɛ a be a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ ban wa de a wɛr ka wʋ ɩ a ba sofʋ. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Ka a Nãaŋmɩn vɛ̃ ka ba kpɩɛrɛ nɩ ɩ̃gan 'maar nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn dɔ̃ɔ pol kʋ a ba sãakpãmine. Ka a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa gba ba wa tʋ̃ↄ ba ɛ, bojũu, Nãaŋmɩn kʋn a Isɩral nɩbɛ jɛtʋ̃ↄ fʋ yin a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine sɛ̃. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />A Nãaŋmɩn tu naa a wʋ polfʋ a jaa wʋn pol kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Josʋwa Na Vɛ̃ Ka A Bʋrsɩ Bala Na Be A mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ Purfʋ Jie Kul A Ba Tẽe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa bʋɔl a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie lɔ̃ↄ taa. <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />Na wʋ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ maal naa a lɛ jaa a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na wiil ɩka yɩ maal, yɩ mɩ tu naa a n yelbinsɩ a jaa. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />A sɔ̃ↄ nyã wʋ jaa, yaa tↄr a yɩ yɛɛr Isɩral nɩbɛ bar ɛ. Yɩ tʋ̃ↄn tu a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn yelbinsɩ a jaa. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Pʋ̃pãanyã, nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn pol kʋ yɩ, a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn kʋ naa a yɩ taaba Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩ̃gan 'maar. A lɛ jũu, yɩ lɩɛb kul a yɩ wɛr 'lↄ pↄ na ɩ a yɩ sofʋ, a wɛr 'lↄ na be a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, be a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Mosesɩ na kʋ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Yɩ mɔ̃ tu a yelbinsɩ ala a Mosesɩ na kpãkpãan yɩ, yɩ nʋ̃ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn, yɩ maala a wʋ bↄfʋ, yɩ turo a wʋ yelbinsɩ, yɩ tara yelmɩ̃ɛ kʋ wʋ, na yɩ tʋ̃nɔ kʋrɔ wʋ nɩ a yɩ nyãa nɩ a yɩ sɩɛ wʋ jaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6-8" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr nɛvɩla, tɩ vɛ̃ ka ba kul, na wʋ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ ben kulo a yɩ yie nɩ bʋ̃tarsɩ, a dʋ̃yɔɔ nɩ kpãna nɩ sɛlma nɩ kur-jɩɛ nɩ kur na tara tɔ̃nɔ nɩ bʋ̃sursɩ yɔɔ. Yɩ tɩ põn a yɩ yɛɛr a bonsɩ ala yɩn wa fa yin a yɩ dɔ̃dɔ̃mine sɛ̃.&gt;&gt; Ka ba pãa yi kulo a ba tẽe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 22:6-8">Mosesɩ dɔ̃ɔ de a Jɔɔdan man mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie kʋ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ ŋmãa, tɩchɛ a bʋrɔ ŋmãa bala na chɛ, Josʋwa mɩ kʋ ba naa wɛr a be a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie 'mãtãan a bʋrsɩ bamine.<verse eid="JOS 22:6-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Tɩchɛ ka a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie lɩɛb kul a ba tẽe. Ba bar a Isɩral nɩbɛ bala na chɛ be a Silo na be a Keena wɛr pↄ tɩ yi chen a ba mɩ̃ɛ wɛr pↄ na be a Giliyadɩ wɛr pↄ nɩtãa a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na kpãkpãan ba tu a Mosesɩ sɛ̃.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Nãaŋmɩn Bɔɔrlo Jɛkpulo Ban Mɛ A Jɔɔdan Man Par</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />A sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie, na wa ta a Gɛlɩlↄfʋ na chɛnɛ ɩ a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie, ba mɛn a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na bɛrma gbʋr a man. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Ba wa 'yɛr kʋ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Yɩ chɛlɛ! A Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie mɛn Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrlo jɛkpulo be a Gɛlɩlↄfʋ, a Jɔɔdan lõboor na ɩ a sɩ gɔ̃ɔn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />A Isɩral nɩbɛ na wa wõ a nɩtɔ̃, a tẽe wʋ jaa 'yir lɔ̃ɔ taa be a Silo na tɩ jɛb a bʋrsɩ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Ka Isɩral nɩbɛ pãa tʋ̃ Eliasa na ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro bidaba Fɩnɩhasɩ, a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie a Giliyadɩ wɛr pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Dↄↄr pie na yi a bʋrsɩ pie pↄ na ɩ dɔ̃dɔr jaa nidier na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie lɔ̃ↄn chiin a Fɩnɩhasɩ.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Ba wan be a Giliyadɩ wɛr pɔ, a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie sɛ̃, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />wa ara kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn nɩbɛ tɩ 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Bo lɛ so ka yɩ maal a yeldɛɛr nyã tɩɛ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn? Yɩ tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ tɩ na yɩ mɛ a bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo nyã kʋ a yɩ mɩn. Yaa lɛ chɛnɛ turo a Nãaŋmɩn ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Yɩ tɩɛr a sɩ yelbier 'lɔ be a Pɩyↄ, a lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na dↄↄr a wʋ mɩ̃ɛ nɩbɛ ba jaa nɩ a baal dɛɛr. Sɩ chɛnɛ na be dire a pↄ dↄↄyɛ, a yelbier 'lↄ ba sɛɛ ɛ? <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Yɩ bʋↄrↄ naa ɩka yɩ tↄr a wʋ tufʋ bɩɩ? Yɩn be tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ a dɩna, wʋn nyɛ̃n suur 'yɔ̃ɔ a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa a bio. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />A lɛ pʋ̃pãanyã, ala ɩ a yɩ wɛr ba sɛɛ ɩka yɩ puoro a Nãaŋmɩn ɛ, yɩ gɔ̃ɔ wa a Nãaŋmɩn wɛr pↄ, be a wʋ fɔbaa puorfʋ yir na be. Yɩ wa de a sɩ wɛr lõboor ɩ̃sʋɔ, tɩchɛ a ba sɛɛ ɩka yɩ tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ bɩɩ maal sɩ a sɩ mɩ tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ na sɩ lɛ mɛ a bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ pʋɔ a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a sɩ Ŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo pɔ ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Yɩ tɩɛr Sera bidaba Akan na tↄr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ nɩ a bonsɩ ala an sɛɛ ɩka ba ta sɔ̃ↄ bar, a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa nyɛ̃n a dↄↄrfʋ a lɛ jũu. Akan tɛɛ ba lɛ kpi a wʋ yelbier kũu ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ka a Wuruben nɩ a Gaadɩ nɩ a Manaasɩ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie pãa 'yɛr kʋ a bʋrɔ nɩbɛrɛ bala na yi a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie wa a ba sɛ̃ ɩka, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />&lt;&lt;A Ŋmɩn lɛ ɩ a kpɛ̃ɔ sʋↄ! 'Lↄ lɛ ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn, a Ŋmɩn lɛ ɩ a kpɛ̃ɔ sʋↄ! 'Lↄ lɛ ɩ a Nãaŋmɩn! Wʋ bɔ̃ɔn a bon 'lↄ jũu sɩn ɩ a nɩtɔ̃, ka sɩ pãa mɩ bʋↄrↄ ɩka yɩ bɔ̃ↄ! Ala ɩ sɩ tɔraa na saa tu a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ ɛ, yɩ ta bar sɩ a sɩ chɛnɛ vʋrɔ ɛ! <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Ala ɩ sɩ tↄr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ tɩ mɩ mɛ sɩ mɩ̃ɛ bↄↄrlo jɛkpulo, na sɩ ma chʋm a sɩ lorsɩ bɩɩ a sɩ bʋ̃bie lorsɩ bɩɩ a sɩ lɔ̃ɔ-taa lorsɩ, a Nãaŋmɩn mɩ̃ɛ wʋ wa dↄↄr sɩ. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Kai! Sɩ ɩ naa a lɛ bojũu, sɩ joro na dãbɩ̃ɛ ɩka sɔ̃ↄ kɔ̃ↄ na wa ta na, a yɩ yɔnsuulsɩ na 'yɛr kʋ a sɩ yɔnsuulsɩ ɩka, &lt;Bo guortaa lɛ a yɩn nɩ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a Isɩral nɩbɛ Ŋmɩn tara? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Wʋ vɛ̃n ka a Jɔɔdan man ɩ tɔr-bɔɔ gã a sɩn nɩ a yɩn Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ chara pɔ. Yɩn nɩ a Nãaŋmɩn ba tara guortaa jaa ɛ.&gt; Amine a yɩ yɔnsuulsɩ na wa vɛ̃n ka a sɩ yɔnsuulsɩ bar a Nãaŋmɩn puorfʋ. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />A lɛ jũu lɛ sɩ mɛn a bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na ba ɩ a jie 'lↄ sɩn na chʋm a bↄↄrlo bomo bɩɩ lorsɩ ɛ, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />tɩchɛ, ka a na ɩ jɩ̃nɛ kʋ sɩn nɩ a yɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a dɔɔ tutaa bala nɩ na wa ɩka sɩrɛ jaa, sɩ ma puor a Nãaŋmɩn a wʋ jichɛchɛ niem nɩ a sɩ lorsɩ sɩn na chʋm, nɩ a sɩ bↄↄrlo bomo nɩ a sɩ lɔ̃ɔ-taa lorsɩ. Sɩ ɩ naa a nɩtɔ̃ ka a yɩ yɔnsuulsɩ taa wa yɛr kʋ a sɩ yɔnsuulsɩ ɩka, saa tara guortaa nɩ a Nãaŋmɩn ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />A sɩ tɩɛr lɛ ɩka, ala ɩ a nɩtɔ̃ wa ɩ naa, a sɩ yɔnsuulsɩ na wa 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;Yɩ kaa, a sɩ sãakpãmine mɛn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na nyɛ̃taan a Nãaŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo. Waa dɔ̃ɔ ɩ bↄↄrlo bomo chʋmfʋ jie bɩɩ lorsɩ jie lɛ ɛ, tɩchɛ wʋ ɩ naa jɩ̃nɛ kʋ a sɩn nɩ a yɩ nɩbɛ.&gt; <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Sɩ kʋ wa tɔr a Nãaŋmɩn nɛɛ bɩɩ tɔr a wʋ tufʋ a pʋ̃pãanyã tɩ na sɩ mɛ bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na sɩ ma chʋm lorsɩ bɩɩ bʋ̃bie lorsɩ bɩɩ bɔɔrlo bomo ɛ. Sɩ kʋ mɛ bɔɔrlo jɛkpul yuo jaa ka a ba ɩ Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a sɩ Ŋmɩn bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo na ara a wʋ fɔbaa puorfʋ yir niem ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro Fɩnɩhasɩ nɩ a nidierbe pie bala na yi a tẽe pↄ na ɩ a bʋrɔ jaa nidier na yi a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie wõn a lɛ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩ a Manaasɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ bala na be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie na 'yɛr, ka a ba pʋɔ pɛl. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />A Nãaŋmɩn bↄↄrloro Fɩnɩhasɩ na ɩ a Eliasa bidaba 'yɛr kʋ ba ɩka, &lt;&lt;Pʋ̃pãanyã lɛ sɩ bɔ̃ↄ ɩka a Nãaŋmɩn ben a sɩ sɛ̃, yaa tɔr a wʋ nɛɛ ɛ, a lɛ jũu yɩ faan a Isɩral nɩbɛ yin a Nãaŋmɩn dↄↄrfʋ pↄ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Ka a Fɩnɩhasɩ nɩ a nɩbɛrɛ pãa bar a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ Gaadɩ bʋrɔ be a Giliyadɩ tɩ lɩɛb chen be a Keena a Isɩral nɩbɛ pↄ tɩ man ba a lɛ na ɩ. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Ka a Isɩral nɩbɛ pʋɔ pɛl nɩ a lɛ ban wõ ka ba dãna a Ŋmɩn. Baa lɛ 'yɛrɛ ɩka ban tɩ jɛb sɔ̃ↄ a jie 'lↄ a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ na kpɩɛrɛ ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Ka a Wuruben bʋrɔ nɩ a Gaadɩ bʋrɔ nɩbɛ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;A bɔɔrlo jɛkpulo nyã ɩ naa dãasɩɛ ɩka, a Ŋmɩn ɩ naa Nãaŋmɩn.&gt;&gt; Ka ba pãa bʋɔlɔ a jie, &lt;&lt;Dãasɩɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dãasɩɛ par lɛ yele fʋn nyɛ̃n nibir</char></note>.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">A Josʋwa 'Yɛr Baaraa Wʋn 'Yɛr Kʋ A Isɩral Nɩbɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />An wa kor jaa, Nãaŋmɩn gu naa a Isɩral nɩbɛ yin a ba dɔ̃dɔ̃mine nuur pↄ, a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Josʋwa na kor nyɔ̃ↄ, <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />ka wʋ pãa bʋɔl a Isɩral nɩbɛ ba jaa nɩ a nɩbɛrɛ nɩ a nidierbe nɩ a 'yɛr tↄↄrbↄ nɩ a nɩjur na be a nɩbɛ pɔ na wʋ 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Pʋ̃pãanyã, n kor nyɔ̃ɔ. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Yɩ nyɛ̃n a lɛ jaa a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn na maal a paalsɩ anyã a jaa a yɩ jũu. A Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn lɛ ma jɛɛrɛ kʋrↄ yɩ sɔ̃ↄ jaa. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />N põn a paalsɩ ala na chɛ kʋ a yɩ bʋrsɩ nɩ a paalsɩ ala n na tʋ̃ↄ jɛb de kʋ yɩ be a Jɔɔdan man pↄ, be a mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie tɩ tan be a Mɛditɛrɛniya mandal mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ mʋrfʋ jie. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />A Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn na vɛ̃n ka ba lɩɛb puor jo, ka wʋ pãa dii ba a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩn wa chiini. Yɩn den a ba wɛr nɩtãa lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn na pol kʋ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />A lɛ jũu, yɩ kaara sʋ̃ na yɩ turo a lɛ jaa na sɛb a Mosesɩ yelbinsɩ gan pↄ. Yɩ taa wa bara ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ɛ, <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />na yɩ taa wa de a yɩ mɩ̃ɛ tɩ lɔ̃ↄnɔ nɩ a nɩbɛ banyãna na chɛ be a yɩ pɔ bɩɩ bʋɔlɔ a ba ŋmɩmɛ bɩɩ de a ŋmɩmɛ yoe bine nɩ nɛɛ ɛ, bɩɩ puoro a ŋmɩmɛ ala bɩɩ gburo a ba niem ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Tɩchɛ, yɩ tara yelmɩ̃ɛ kʋ a Nãaŋmɩn nɩtãa a lɛ yɩn be wa tan a sɔ̃ↄ nyã. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />A Nãaŋmɩn diin paalsɩ ala na bɛrɛ̃sɩ tɩ kpɛ̃mɛ a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩn chiini, ka ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ba tʋ̃ↄ jɛb yɩ ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />A yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa na tʋ̃ↄn dii dↄↄr tur ka ba jo, bojũu a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn lɛ jɛɛrɛ kʋrↄ yɩ nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn pol bin. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />A lɛ jũu, yɩ kaara sʋ̃, na yɩ nʋ̃ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Yɩn wa tɔr tɩ lɔ̃ɔn a paalsɩ bala na chɛnɛ be a yɩ pↄ nɩbɛ, na yɩ kulo taar, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />yɩ bɔ̃ɔn ɩka, a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn kʋ lɛ dii a paalsɩ anyãna bar a yɩ niem ɛ. Tɩchɛ ban tʋ̃ɔn vɛ̃ ka yɩ di dↄↄyɛ, na ba ɩ chɛbaa bɩɩ bɔɔ kʋ yɩ, ka a ɔɔrɔ nɩtãa kpaaraa ban fɔɔrɔ nɩ fʋ dũkur ju, bɩɩ ɩ gʋʋr chɔɔrɔ yɩ a nibie. Lɛ lɛ yɩn di a dↄↄyɛ tɩ tan a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩ jaa na wa baar a wɛr mɩ̃ɛ nyã a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn na kʋ yɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />&lt;&lt;Pʋ̃pãanyã a n sɔ̃ↄ tan ɩka n kpi. A yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa bɔ̃ɔn naa a wʋ nyãa nɩ a wʋ sɩɛ pↄ ɩka a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn den a bʋ̃mɩn a jaa kʋ yɩ nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn pol. Wʋ tun a wʋ polfʋsɩ a jaa wʋn pol, waa bar a ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Tɩchɛ nɩtãa a lɛ wʋn tu a wʋ polfʋsɩ a jaa kʋ yɩ, lɛ mɩ lɛ wʋn waan a yeldɛbɛ ala a jaa wʋn 'yɛr. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Ala ɩ yaa wa tu a nɛbõ'yen 'lↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na ɩ a yɩ Ŋmɩn na kpãkpãan yɩ ɩka yɩ tu ɛ, tɩ na yɩ puoro tɩ tʋ̃nɔ kʋrɔ ŋmɩn yor, wʋn dɔɔr yɩ naa nɩ a wʋ suur, a kʋ̃ kor ɛ, a yɩ ɩ̃sʋɔ jaa kʋ̃ chɛnɛ a wɛr mɩ̃ɛ nyã pɔ wʋn kʋ yɩ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">A Josʋwa Na 'Yɛr A Nɩbɛ Be A Sɛchɛm Tẽe Pɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Ka a Josʋwa bʋɔl a Isɩral bʋrɔ ba jaa lɔ̃ɔ taa be a Sɛchɛm. Wʋ bʋɔl a nɩbɛrɛ nɩ a nidierbe nɩ a 'yɛr tↄↄrbↄ nɩ a nɩjur na be a Isɩral ka ba wa be a Ŋmɩn niem.<verse eid="JOS 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Nɩtɔ̃ lɛ a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn tara ɩka wʋ 'yɛr, &lt;Sɔ̃ↄ kɔ̃ↄ na po, a yɩ sãakpãmine dɔ̃ɔ be a Yufɩratɩ man gɔ̃ↄn puoro ŋmɩn yor.&gt; A yɩ sãakpãmine bala ɩ̃sʋɔ lɛ ɩ Tɛra na ɩ a Abraham nɩ a Nahↄ sãa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Tɩchɛ ka n pãa 'yir a yɩ sãakpã Abraham yin be a Yufɩratɩ wɛr pↄ de wʋ yↄn a Keena wɛr wʋ jaa. N kʋ wʋn yɔnsuulsɩ yɔɔ. N kʋ wʋ naa Asikɩ, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />na n mɩ de Jekɔb nɩ Isɔb kʋ a Asikɩ. N den a Ɛdↄn na be a tɔ̃ↄ paal kʋ a Isɔb ka wʋ ɩ a wʋ sofʋ, tɩchɛ ka a yɩ sãakpã 'lɔ nɩ a wʋ bibiir chen a Ijipitɩ. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />A lɛ puor, N mɩ chiin naa Mosesɩ nɩ Aarɔn, tɩ na N waan dↄↄrfʋ wa 'yɔ̃ɔ a Ijipitɩ tẽe pↄ. Tɩchɛ n 'yir yɩn yin a dↄↄrfʋ pɔ. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />N 'yir a yɩ sãakpãmine yin a Ijipitɩ, ka a Ijipitɩ nɩbɛ de wiir torokosɩ dire nɩ ba. Tɩchɛ a sɔ̃ɔ 'lɔ a yɩ sãakpãmine na wa ta a man-jɩɛ par, <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />ba kon bʋɔl ma ɩka N sʋ̃ʋ ba, ka N vɛ̃ ka libe be a bala nɩ a Ijipitɩ nɩbɛ chara pↄ. N vɛ̃n ka a kʋ̃ↄ pↄↄ a Ijipitɩ nɩbɛ ka ba jaa kpi. Yɩ bɔ̃ɔn a lɛ N na maal a Ijipitɩ nɩbɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:7">&lt;&lt;&lt;Yɩ dɔ̃ɔ jɛ̃ a dãlpʋɔ ju kor jaa&gt; <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Tɩchɛ ka n pãa wa de yɩ waan a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ bala na kpɩɛrɛ a Jɔɔdan mɔ̃tɔ̃ɔ purfʋ jie wɛr pɔ. Ba jɛb yɩ naa, tɩchɛ ka n kʋ yɩ jɛb tʋ̃ↄ fʋ. Yɩ de naa a ba wɛr tɩchɛ ka N kʋ ba a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ yɩn chiini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Ka a Mowab nãa Balakɩ na ɩ a Sɩpↄr bidaba 'yir jɛb yɩ. Wʋ tʋ̃n 'yɛr kʋ Balam na ɩ a Bɩyↄ bidaba ɩka wʋ pↄ 'yɔ̃ↄ yɩ. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Tɩchɛ n ba tu a Balam nɛɛ ɛ, a lɛ jũu ka wʋ bɩɛl yɩ, a nɩtɔ̃ lɛ N tu faa yɩ yin a Balakɩ nuur pↄ. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Yɩn gɔ̃ɔ a Jɔɔdan man wa a Jɛrɩko, a Jɛrɩko nɩbɛ 'yir jɛb yɩ nɩtãa a lɛ a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Perisi nɩbɛ nɩ a Keena nɩbɛ nɩ a Hiti nɩbɛ nɩ a Gɛrɩgasɩ nɩbɛ nɩ a Hivi nɩbɛ nɩ a Jebusɩ nɩbɛ na dɔ̃ɔ jɛb yɩ. Tɩchɛ N vɛ̃ naa a yɩ jɛb tʋ̃ↄ ba. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Yɩn wa chiini, n vɛ̃n ka dãbɩ̃ɛ kpɛ ba, lɛ an na ɩ ka N dii a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ nãmine ayi bala bar. A yɩ sɔkpɛ̃ɛ nɩ a yɩ tãm ba lɛ yɩ jɛb ba ɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />N kʋ yɩn wɛr 'lↄ yɩn ba kↄ jaa ɛ, nɩ a tẽbɛrɛ ala yɩn ba mɛ yaa ɛ. Pʋ̃pãanyã, yɩ kpɩɛrɛ na a be dire a tɩɩr wɔ̃mɔ ala yɩn ba bʋr ɛ, na yɩ dire a tɩɩr kãa ala yɩn ba bʋr ɛ.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Ka a Josʋwa choo 'yɛr ɩka, &lt;&lt;Pʋ̃pãanyã yɩ 'yɔ̃ↄnↄ a Nãaŋmɩn na yɩ puoro wʋ sɩrɛ jaa nɩ sↄↄfʋ. Yɩ bar a ŋmɩmɛ ala a yɩ sãakpãmine na dɔ̃ɔ puoro be a Mɛsopotamɩya nɩ a Ijipitɩ tɩ puoro a Nãaŋmɩn tɛɛ. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ala ɩ yaa sↄↄ na puoro wʋ ɛ, a dɩna yɩ kaa 'yir a nɩrɛ 'lↄ yɩ na puoro, a ŋmɩmɛ ala a yɩ sãakpãmine na dɔ̃ɔ puoro a Mɛsopotamɩya bɩɩ a ŋmɩmɛ ala ban dɔ̃ɔ puoro a Amɔrɩ, a bala wɛr pↄ yɩn be a pʋ̃pãanyã. Tɩchɛ maa nɩ a n yir deme 'lↄ, sɩn puor a Nãaŋmɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Ka a nɩbɛ 'yɛr sɔɔ wʋ, &lt;&lt;Sɩn kʋ bar a Nãaŋmɩn tɩ puor ŋmɩn yor ɛ! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />A Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a sɩ Ŋmɩn lɛ 'yir sɩn nɩ a sɩ sãakpãmine yin a gbãgba-tʋ̃mɔ̃ pↄ a Ijipitɩ, sɩ nyɛ̃n a nɛkõ-tʋ̃mɔ̃ ala wʋn tʋ̃. Wʋ gu sɩ naa a paalsɩ ala a jaa pↄ sɩn tu tal. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Sɩn chen wa ta a wɛr nyãna pↄ, a Nãaŋmɩn dii naa a Amɔrɩ nɩbɛ bala ba jaa na be a ka bar. A lɛ jũu, sɩ mɩ na puor a Nãaŋmɩn, wʋ ɩ naa a sɩ Ŋmɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ɩka, &lt;&lt;Tɩchɛ, amine yɩn lɛ kʋ tʋ̃ↄ puor a Nãaŋmɩn ɛ. Wʋ ɩ naa Ŋmɩn chɛchɛ na wʋ kʋ vɛ̃ a yɩ yeldɛɛr bar ɛ. Wʋ kʋ sↄↄ ka yɩ lɛ puor ŋmɩn jaa pʋɔ wʋ ɛ, <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />yɩn mɩ wa bar wʋ tɩ puor ŋmɩn yuo, wʋn 'yir tɩɛ yɩ na wʋ dɔɔr yɩ. Wʋn sɔ̃ↄ yɩn bar, wʋn gba na sɔɔ ɩ kʋ yɩ, tɩchɛ wʋn sɔ̃ↄ yɩ naa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Ka a nɩbɛ 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Kai! sɩn puor a Nãaŋmɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr kʋ ba, &lt;&lt;Yɩn mɩ̃ɛ lɛ di a yɩ mɩ̃ɛ dãasɩɛ ɩka yɩ kaan 'yir na puor a Nãaŋmɩn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Ka ba 'yɛr, &lt;&lt;Sɩ din a dãasɩɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Ka a Josʋwa 'yɛr, &lt;&lt;Yɩ lɔb a yɩ ŋmɩmɛ ala yɩn tara bar, tɩ na yɩ bin nɛɛ ɩka yɩn den a yɩ nyãa wʋ jaa turo nɩ a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a Isɩral Ŋmɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ka a nɩbɛ pãa 'yɛr kʋ a Josʋwa ɩka, &lt;&lt;Sɩn puor a Nãaŋmɩn 'lɔ na ɩ a sɩ Ŋmɩn. Sɩn tu naa a wʋ yelbinsɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Ka a Josʋwa ɩn a nɩbɛ nɛbõ'yen a daar 'lↄnɔ, tɩ pãa de a yelbinsɩ kʋ ba be a Sɛchɛm tẽe pↄ ka ban turo. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Josʋwa sɛb a yelbinsɩ anyãna 'yɔ̃ɔ a Ŋmɩn yelbinsɩ gan pↄ kʋ ba. Tɩ pãa 'mↄↄ kʋsɩr kpɛ̃ɛ tɩ ba tɩkpɛ̃ɛ kɔ̃ɔ pilem na gbʋr be a Nãaŋmɩn puorfʋ yir.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Wʋ 'yɛr kʋ a nɩbɛ ba jaa ɩka, &lt;&lt;A kʋsɩr nyã lɛ na ɩ a sɩ dãasɩɛ. Wʋ wõn a 'yɛr ala a jaa a Nãaŋmɩn na 'yɛr kʋ sɩ. Wʋn ɩ naa dãasɩɛ 'lↄ na gã, ka yɩ kʋ tʋ̃ↄ tɔr a yɩ Ŋmɩn nɛɛ ɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JOS 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Ka a Josʋwa pãa bar ba ka a nɩrɛ jaa lɩɛb chen a wʋ paal pↄ.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Josʋwa Nɩ Eliasa Kũu Yele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />A anyã puor, a Nãaŋmɩn tʋ̃tʋ̃nɔ Josʋwa na ɩ a Nun bidaba kpi naa a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ wʋn nyɛ̃ yuomo kↄbaa dↄↄl pie (110). <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Ka ba ũu wʋ a wʋ mɩ̃ɛ wɛr pↄ, a Tɩmɩnafʋ Sɛra tẽe na be a tɔ̃ↄ paal pɔ, na ɩ a Ɛfɩrem paal na be a Gaasɩ tɔ̃ↄ sa-par dɩr jie.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Tɩ tan a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ a Josʋwa na wa kpi, a nɩbɛ puor a Nãaŋmɩn a sɔ̃ↄ 'lↄ wʋ jaa, na ba chɛnɛ puoro a Nãaŋmɩn wʋn wa kpi puor, bojũu a nidierbe bala na chɛnɛ be be nyɛ̃n a bon 'lↄ jaa a Nãaŋmɩn na maal kʋ a Isɩral.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />A nɩbɛ den a Josefʋ kũu ban yin a Ijipitɩ waan wa ũu be a Sɛchɛm, a wɛr 'lↄ a Jekɔb na de a libi kue kɔbaa dan yin a Hamↄr bidↄↄr sɛ̃ na ɩ a Sɛchɛm sãa. A wɛr nyã lɛ a Josefʋ yɔnsuulsɩ de ka wʋ ɩ a ba kpɩ̃ɩn bon.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />A Aarɔn bidaba Eliasa kpi naa ka ba ũu wʋ be a Gibɩya, a tẽe 'lↄ na be a tɔ̃ↄ ju na ɩ a Ɛfɩrem paal 'lɔ ban kʋ a wʋ bidaba Fɩnɩhasɩ.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>